<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2KI" style="id" />
  <para style="h">2 LUKER</para>
  <para style="toc1">Buk me aryo pa Luker</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Luker</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Buk me aryo pa</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUKER</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Buk me aryo pa Luker </char> mede ki tito lok ma mako ker aryo me Icrael ki kama <char style="bk">buk pa Luker </char> me acel ogiko iye. Buk man iye opoke i dul aryo: (1) lok ma mako ker aryo me Icrael i dye mwaka 1900 ma onongo pud peya kinywalo Yecu Kricito nio kwede wa ikare ma Camaria opoto kwede ki agiki ker me Icrael i mwaka 722 ma onongo pud peya kinywalo Yecu Kricito; (2) lok ma mako ker me Juda cake ikare ma ker me Icrael opoto iye nio wa ikare ma Nebukadnejar me Babilon omayo dok obalo ki Jerucalem i mwaka 586 ma onongo pud peya ki nywalo Yecu Kricito. Buk man gik kun loko ikom Gedalia ma laloc me Juda ite loc pa jo Babilon, ka dok miyo lok pi gonyo rwot Jekoiakin me Juda nia ki i gang buc matye i lobo Babilon.</para>
  <para style="ip">Can magi opoto ikom lobo Icrael ki Juda pien rwodigi onongo pe gubedo lugen ikom Rwot. Balo Jerucalem kitero jo ma iye macalo opii i rok obedo alokaloka madit tutwal i ker kwaro pa jo Icrael.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lanebi ma pire tek mada i buk pa Luker me aryo en aye obedo Elica ma oleyo katyen Eliya.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">I lobo Icrael opoke aryo <char style="ior"><ref loc="2KI 1:1-17:41">1:1—17:41</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">a. Lanebi Elica <char style="ior"><ref loc="2KI 1:1-8:15">1:1—8:15</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">b. Luker me Juda ki me Icrael <char style="ior"><ref loc="2KI 8:16-17:4">8:16—17:4</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">c. Kit ma lobo Camaria opoto kwede <char style="ior"><ref loc="2KI 17:5-41">17:5-41</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ker me Juda <char style="ior"><ref loc="2KI 18:1-25:30">18:1—25:30</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">a. Cake ki ikom Kejekia nio ikom Yocia <char style="ior"><ref loc="2KI 18:1-21:26">18:1—21:26</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">b. Loc pa rwot Yocia <char style="ior"><ref loc="2KI 22:1-23:30">22:1—23:30</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">c. Rwodi me agiki me Juda <char style="ior"><ref loc="2KI 23:31-24:20">23:31—24:20</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">d. Kit ma Jerucalem opoto kwede <char style="ior"><ref loc="2KI 25:1-30">25:1-30</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2KI 1" />
  <para style="s1">Eliya gin ki rwot Akajia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 1:1" />Ikare ma Akab oto, jo Moab gucako jemo woko ikom Icrael.<verse eid="2KI 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 1:2" />Inino mo acel, Akajia opoto piny ki iwang dirica ki i kicikane mamalo ma i Camaria, ci owane matek adada; omiyo ocwalo lukwena, kun waco botgi ni, “Wucit wupeny dog Baal-jebub, lubanga pa jo Ekron, kace abicang ki i ret man.” <verse eid="2KI 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 1:3" />Ento lamalaika pa Rwot owaco ki Eliya ma Laticbe ni, “A malo, wek icit irom ki lukwena pa rwot Akajia me Camaria ci iwac botgi ni, ‘Wutimo kuman ni Lubanga mo pe i Icrael, ma omiyo wucito ka penyo dog Baal-jebub, ma lubanga pa jo Ekron?’ <verse eid="2KI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 1:4" />Wac bot rwot Akijia ni Rwot owaco ni, ‘In pe dong ibicang ki ikom ret ma inongoni, ento i bito woko ada.’” Ci Eliya oa ocito orwate ki lukwena pa Akijia kit ma Rwot owaco.<verse eid="2KI 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 1:5" />Lukwena gudok bot rwot, ci en openyogi ni, “Pingo wudwogo cen?” <verse eid="2KI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 1:6" />Ci gugamo ni, “Dano mo oromo kwedwa i yoo, ci owaco botwa ni, ‘Wudok cen bot rwot ma oorowuni, wek wucit wuwac bote ni, Rwot Lubanga owaco kuman ni, onongo i tamoni pien Lubanga mo pe i Icrael, omiyo i cwalo ni ki peny dog Baal-jebub, ma lubanga pa jo Ekron? Pi kit tim man, omiyo in pe i bicang ki ikom retini, ento i bito woko ada.’” <verse eid="2KI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 1:7" />Ci rwot openyogi ni, “Dano ma orwate kwedwuni ci oloko botwu lok magi ducuni obedo ningning?” <verse eid="2KI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 1:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:4">Mat 3:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:6">Mar 1:6</ref></char></note> Ci gugamo ni, “En oruku ginaruka ma obedo yeryer, kun otweyo pyere ki del.” Ci ogamo ni, “Meno en Eliya Laticbe.”<verse eid="2KI 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 1:9" />Ci rwot ocwalo ladit me mony maloyo jo pyere abic kacel ki jone pyere abic. En onongo Eliya obedo malo iwi got, ci owaco bote ni, “Ai dano pa Lubanga, rwot owaco ni, ‘I lor piny.’” <verse eid="2KI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 1:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 9:54">Luk 9:54</ref></char></note>Ento Eliya ogamo dog ladit me mony maloyo jo pyere abici ni, “Ka an aye a dano pa Lubanga ada, wek mac oa ki malo i polo owang in woko kacel ki joni pyere abici ducu.” Ci mac oa ki malo i polo owango en ki jone pyere abici woko ducu.<verse eid="2KI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 1:11" />Ci rwot Akijia dok ocwalo ladit me mony mukene maloyo jo pyere abic kacel ki jone pyere abic bot Eliya. Guwaco bote dok ni, “Ai dano pa Lubanga, man aye cik pa rwot ni, ‘Ilor piny oyotoyot.’” <verse eid="2KI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 1:12" />Ento Eliya odok iye ki gin ni, “Kace an a dano pa Lubanga, wek mac oa ki malo i polo opot ikomwu owangwu woko ducu, in kacel ki joni pyere abici ducu.” Ci mac pa Lubanga oa ki malo i polo owango en ki jone pyere abici ducu.<verse eid="2KI 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 1:13" />Ka rwot Akijia owinyo ci ocwalo ladit me mony me adeke maloyo dano pyere abic, kacel ki jone pyere abic dok aye. Ci ladit me adeke maloyo jo pyere abic ocito. Ka oo, ci opoto orumu conge piny inyim Eliya, obako doge bote ni, “Ai dano pa Lubanga, alegi ni, pe i neka kacel ki jona pyere abici, wek kica omaki ikomwa do! <verse eid="2KI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 1:14" />Pien nen, mac oa ki i polo ci obino piny, owango ludito mony aryo mukwongoni kacel ki jo gi ma giloyoni ducu; ento in iwek pi kwena man obed tek boti.” <verse eid="2KI 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 1:15" />Ci lamalaika pa Rwot owaco bot Eliya ni, “Lworo pe omaki ikome, Lor piny i cit kwede.” Omiyo Eliya oa owoto kacel kwede me cito bot rwot, <verse eid="2KI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 1:16" />ci owaco bote ni, “Rwot owaco kuman ni, ‘Pien icwalo lukwena ka penyo dog Baal-jebub, lubanga pa jo Ekron, calo onongo Lubanga pe i Icrael, omiyo pe ibicang ki ikom ret ma inongoni, ento in ibito woko ada.’”<verse eid="2KI 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 1:17" />Akajia oto ada kit macalo Rwot oloko ki i dog Eliyani, Jekoram ma omine aye odoko rwot ma oleyo katyene, i mwaka me aryo me loc pa Tekoram wod pa Yekocapat, rwot me Juda, pien onongo Akajia pe tye ki wode mo. <verse eid="2KI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 1:18" />Lok kom Akajia mudonge ducu, ma en otiyo, kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro pa Luker me Icrael.</char><verse eid="2KI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2KI 2" />
  <para style="s1">Kitero Eliya i polo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 2:1" />Ikare ma Rwot dong mito tero Eliya woko i polo ki lapiru, onongo Eliya ki Elica gitye i wotgi nia ki i Gilgal. <verse eid="2KI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 2:2" />Eliya owaco bot Elica ni, “Alegi ni kong ibed kany; pien Rwot otyeko cwala woko wa i Betel.” Ento Elica ogamo ni, “Akwongo kwong ki nying Rwot makwoni, dok akwongo bene ki nying in kikomi ma itye makwoni, ni an pe abibwoti.” Kitmeno gucako wot me cito i Betel. <verse eid="2KI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 2:3" />Lwak lunebi mayam gitye i Betel gucito bot Elica ci guwace ni, “In mono ingeyo ni tin Rwot bikwanyo rwodi ki boti ci tere woko?” Ci Elica ogamo ni, “An angeyo loke; dong wuling mot.”<verse eid="2KI 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 2:4" />Ci Eliya owaco bote ni, “Elica, alegi ni kong ibed kany, pien Rwot otyeko cwala woko wa i Jeriko.” Elica ogamo ni, “Akwongo kwong ki nying Rwot matye makwoni, dok akwongo bene ki nying in kikomi ma i tye makwoni, ni an pe abibwoti.” Kitmeno gubino wa i Jeriko. <verse eid="2KI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 2:5" />Lwak lunebi ma gitye i Jeriko gubino bot Elica cok, ci guwaco bote ni, “In mono ingeyo ni tin Rwot bikwanyo rwodi ki boti ci tere woko?” Elica ogamo ni. “An angeyo loke; dong wuling mot.”<verse eid="2KI 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 2:6" />Eliya dok owaco bote ni, “Alegi ni kong ibed kany; pien Rwot ocwala wa i Jordan.” En ogamo ni, “Akwongo kwong ki nying Rwot matye makwoni, dok akwongo bene ki nying in kikomi ma i tye makwoni, ni an pe abibwoti.” Kitmeno gin aryo ducu gumede kiwot kacel. <verse eid="2KI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 2:7" />Lwak lunebi pyere abic bene guwoto kacel kwedgi, ci gucung ki cen kamabor ki gin, ka pud gin aryo ducu gucung i dog Jordan. <verse eid="2KI 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 2:8" />Ci Eliya okwanyo bongone ki ikome, ci odolo woko, ka ogoyo ki pii, ci pii iye opoke woko aryo tungi ki tungi nio ka gin aryo ducu gukato ki i ngom mutwo.<verse eid="2KI 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 2:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 21:17">Nwo 21:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ka gutyeko ngolo loka tungcel, ci Eliya owaco bot Elica ni, “Lega gin ma imito ni atim piri, ma peya kikwanya woko ki boti.” Ci Elica owaco ni, “Alegi, imiya ale kit cwinyini me tiyo tic nebi ma dodo merini tyen aryo.” <verse eid="2KI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 2:10" />Ci Eliya ogamo ni, “Ilego gin matek; ento kace ineno ka kitinga nia ki boti, ci bibedo boti kit ma ilegoni; ento kace pe inena, ci pe bibedo kitmeno.” <verse eid="2KI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 2:11" />Ka onongo pud giwoto kun giloko, ci nen, gadigadi me mac ki aguragura opoko kin gin aryoni woko, ci Eliya ocako cito woko malo i polo ki lapiru madit adada. <verse eid="2KI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 2:12" />Ka Elica oneno ci okok ni, “Wora, wora do! Lacungudwar matek pa jo Icrael!” Ci Elica pe dok omedo ki neno kom Eliya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:12">Ci pi kumu madwong, Elica omako bongo ma ikome oyeco woko i dul aryo. <verse eid="2KI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 2:13" />Ka okwanyo bongo pa Eliya ma opoto piny ma oa ki ikomeni, odok kwede cen ci ocung i dog Jordan. <verse eid="2KI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 2:14" />Ci ogoyo pii ki bongo pa Eliya ma opoto ki ikomeni, kun waco ni, “Rwot Lubanga ma otiyo ki Eliya mono bitic kweda bene?” Ci ma ogoyo pii, ci nen pii iye opoke aryo tungi ki tungi; ci Elica owoto idyere, ongolo loka kulu.<verse eid="2KI 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 2:15" />Ka lwak lunebi ma onongo gitye i Jeriko guneno en okato loka tung botgi, ci guwaco ni, “Cwiny mayam tye ikom Eliya dong otyeko poto ikom Elica.” Ci gubino karomo kwede, ci gukulu wigi piny inyime. <verse eid="2KI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 2:16" />Ci ngat acel ki ikin gi owaco bote ni, “Nen, wan lutici watye jo matego pyere abic. Walego ni i cwalwa wek wacit kayenyo rwodi; gwok nyo Cwiny pa Rwot otinge ci obole woko wa iwi got nyo i notagu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:16">Ento Elica ogamo ni, “Pe kumeno, wun pe omyero wucit.”<verse eid="2KI 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 2:17" />Ento gubedo kadido lok bote ni en owek gicit kayenyo Eliya, ci owaco botgi ni, “Wucit.” Ci jo pyere abici gucito gubedo kayenyo Eliya pi nino adek ci pe gunongo kome. <verse eid="2KI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 2:18" />Ka gudwogo bot Elica ci gunongo en pud tye i Jeriko, ci owaco botgi ni, “An nene pe awaco botwu ni pe wucit?”<verse eid="2KI 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tango ma Elica otiyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 2:19" />Jo ma gin lutela i taun meno gubino ci guwaco bot Elica ni, “Nen ba, taun man tye i kabedo maber ma yomo cwiny, kit ma in laditwa inenoni, ento piine aye rac, ki lobone bene miyo i mon poto woko.” <verse eid="2KI 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 2:20" />Ci en owaco botgi ni, “Wukela awalkwon manyen, ci wuony iye kado.” Ka gukelo awalkwon bote, <verse eid="2KI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 2:21" />ci ocito wa iwang pii, oonyo iye kadonu kun waco ni, “Rwot owaco kuman ni, ‘An dong atyeko kwanyo kwir ma iwang pii man woko; pe dong bikelo to, dok pe bene bimiyo i mon poto.’” <verse eid="2KI 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 2:22" />Kitmeno pii odoko maleng nio wa onyo, kit macalo yam Elica olokoni.<verse eid="2KI 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 2:23" />Lacen Elica oa me cito i Betel, ci ikare ma en tye kawot i wangayo, lutino awobe mogo gua ki i taun gubino gucako nyware, kun giwaco ni, “A woko ki kany in lawiye otal, a woko ki kany in lawiye otal.” <verse eid="2KI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 2:24" />Elica oloke onenogi, ci ocenogi i nying Rwot. Ci nguu ma mon aryo gukati ki i bunga ci gukilo kom awobe pyere angwen wiye aryoni woko. <verse eid="2KI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 2:25" />Elica oa ki kunu ci ocito wa i got Karmel, ka lacen odok i Camaria.<verse eid="2KI 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2KI 3" />
  <para style="s1">Lweny ikin jo Icrael ki jo Moab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 3:1" />I mwaka me apar wiye aboro me ker pa Yekocapat rwot me Juda, en aye Jekoram wod pa Akab ocamo iye ker me loyo Icrael i Camaria, ci obedo kaloc pi mwaka apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="2KI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 3:2" />En otiyo gin manen marac inyim Rwot, kadi pe obedo marom ki pa wone ki pa mine, pien en omuku wir me woro Baal mayam wone otiyoni woko. <verse eid="2KI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 3:3" />Ento en bene obedo katimo kit bal ma Jeroboam wod pa Nebat obedo katimoni, me tero jo Icrael i bal; dok pe omedo ki giko timo bal.<verse eid="2KI 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elica otito pi loyo jo Moab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 3:4" />Meca rwot me Moab yam tye ki romi ma gunya mapol ata; dok en onongo miyo romi alip miya acel, ki yer nyogi romi alip miya acel, mwaka ki mwaka bot rwot me Icrael me nyutu worone ki mar mere ikome pien kere onongo tye ite loc pa rwot me Icrael. <verse eid="2KI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 3:5" />Ento inge to pa Akab, rwot me Moab ojemo woko ikom rwot me Icrael. <verse eid="2KI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 3:6" />Omiyo rwot Jekoram oa woko cut ki i Camaria ikare meno, ci ocoko jo Icrael ducu pi lweny. <verse eid="2KI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 3:7" />Ci ocwalo lok bot Yekocapat rwot me Juda ni, “Rwot me Moab ojemo woko ikoma; ibicito kalweny kweda ikom jo Moab?” Ci Yekocapat ogamo ni, “Abicito, wan acel, lwaka gin aye lwaki, ki aguragurana aye aguragurani bene.” <verse eid="2KI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 3:8" />Dok en openyo ni, “Wabiwot walubu yoo mene?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:8">Jekoram ogamo ni, “Wabilubu yoo ma kemo i tim me Edom.”<verse eid="2KI 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 3:9" />Kitmeno rwot me Icrael ocako cito kacel ki rwot me Juda kacel ki rwot me Edom. Ka gubedo kagono piny pi wot me nino abiro, pii mo pe ononge pi mony kadi pi lee ma gimol i korgi ki yec. <verse eid="2KI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 3:10" />Omiyo rwot me Icrael okok ni, “Maa do! Rwot Lubanga dong nen calo okelo wan luker adeki ducu pi miyowa i cing jo Moab.” <verse eid="2KI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 3:11" />Ci Yekocapat openyo ni, “Lanebi pa Lubanga mo pe kany, wek wapeny dog Rwot ki bote?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:11">Ci ngat acel ikom lutic pa rwot me Icrael ogamo ni, “Elica wod pa Capat aye tye kany, en mayam onongo miyo kony bot Eliyani.”<verse eid="2KI 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 3:12" />Yekocapat owaco botgi ni, “En tye ki lok pa Rwot.” Ci rwot me Icrael ki Yekocapat ki rwot me Edom gucito wa bot Elica.<verse eid="2KI 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 3:13" />Elica owaco bot rwot me Icrael ni, “Gin mo peke ma atwero timo piri. In i cit bot lunebi pa woru ki lunebi pa meni.” Ento rwot me Icrael ogamo ni, “Pe kumeno; pien Rwot aye olwongowa wan luker adeki ducu pi miyowa woko i cing jo Moab.” <verse eid="2KI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 3:14" />Ci Elica ogamo ni, “Akwongo kwong ki nying Rwot me mony matye makwoni, ma atiyo pireni, ni kono nene pe aparo pi Yekocapat rwot me Juda, kono pe aparo piri matwal. <verse eid="2KI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 3:15" />Ento kong dong wukela lago opuk.” Ka lago opuk ocako goyone, ci tek pa Rwot oyido ikome. <verse eid="2KI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 3:16" />Ci owaco ni, “Rwot owaco kuman ni, ‘Abimiyo laora kulu man mutwoni bipong ki pii i iye.’ <verse eid="2KI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 3:17" />Pien Rwot owaco kuman ni, ‘Wun pe wubineno yamo ki kotgu, ento laora kulu aye pii bipong iye, ci wubimato, wun kacel ki dyangiwu ki leewu.’ <verse eid="2KI 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 3:18" />Man gin mayot ki bot Rwot; en bimiyo jo Moab bene i cingwu, <verse eid="2KI 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 3:19" />ci wubiloyo taun ducu ma kirumu ki cel gogo, ki ma ngene, dok bene wubireto yadi mabeco ducu, wubiculu wang piigi woko ducu, wubibalo lobo maberi kun wucoro iye godi.”<verse eid="2KI 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 3:20" />Orwone i odiko, i cawa me tyero gitum kikome, nen pii obino oa ki tung Edom, nio ka pii opongo lobo woko ducu.<verse eid="2KI 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 3:21" />Ka jo Moab ducu guwinyo ni luker gubino kalweny ikomgi, ci gulwongo jo ducu ma gitwero lweny, cake ikom jo matino nio kwede wa ikom ludito, ci gurye iwang lobo. <verse eid="2KI 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 3:22" />Ka gua malo odiko con, ci ceng oryeny ocaro pii, omiyo jo Moab guneno pii ma okemogi nen calo remo. <verse eid="2KI 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 3:23" />Ci guwaco ni, “Man remo do! Luker adeki ki lumonygi gubedo kalweny ikin gi keken gi ci guneke woko do! Eyo wun jo Moab, wacitu kayako jami pa jonu!”<verse eid="2KI 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 3:24" />Ento ka gubino i gony pa jo Icrael, ci jo Icrael ducu gutware malo kalweny ikom jo Moab, ci guringo woko ki inyimgi. Ci jo Icrael gumede ki lubu korgi kun ginekogi ikare ma giringoni. <verse eid="2KI 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 3:25" />Jo Icrael bene gumako taun gi ci gubalo woko, ki poti mabeco ducu bene dano acel acel obolo iye got, nio ka godi opongo potigi. Guculu wang piigi woko ducu, dok gutongo yadi mabeco bene ducu; nio ka godi keken aye odong i Kir-karecet, ci lucel latangdingo gurumu taun meno nio ka guloyo. <verse eid="2KI 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 3:26" />Ka rwot me Moab oneno ni mony dong ogeto marac ikome ci ocito ki wegi pala lucwan miya abiro wek ekem ki ngwec e bar dye mony pa Icrael atir wek elwi woko bot rwot me Edom, ci pe gutwero. <verse eid="2KI 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 3:27" />Ci omako wode madite ma onongo bileyo katyene, ci otyero en me bedo gitum awanga bot Kemoc lubanga pa jo Moab. Omiyo lworo madit opoto ikom jo Icrael; ci gua gudok cen i lobogi.<verse eid="2KI 3:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2KI 4" />
  <para style="s1">Elica okonyo dako ma lacan ma cware oto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 4:1" />Ikare meno dako mo acel ma ikin mon pa lunebi ocito okok bot Elica ni, “Cwara ma latici oto woko; in bene ingeyo ni latici yam lworo Rwot, ento won banya obino kamako lutino awobena aryo wek gubed opiine.” <verse eid="2KI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 4:2" />Ci Elica ogamo ni, “Imito ni atimi gin ango? Waca, gin ango ma itye kwede i odi?” Ci dakonu ogamo ni, “Pe atye ki gin mo i ot ladit, kono nyo adomo moo matidi mo aye tye.”<verse eid="2KI 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 4:3" />Ci Elica owaco bote ni, “Cit ileg agulu mapol ma igi nono ki bot luwoti ducu wek ikelgi. <verse eid="2KI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 4:4" />Ka in ki lutino awobeni wudony i ot, ci ilor dogola iceg wiwu woko i ot, ka iony moo i lwak agulu meno ducu; kace acel acel opong, ci iket ocung cen.”<verse eid="2KI 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 4:5" />Ci dakonu ocito ci oloro dogola, ocego wiye ki wi lutino awobene aryonu; ka en tye kaonyo moo i igi ci gin gikelo agulu mukene bote. <verse eid="2KI 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 4:6" />Ka agulu ducu opong woko, ci owaco bot wode ni, “Kel agulu mukene.” Ci ogamo ni, “Mukene dong peke.” Ci moo otugi gik woko ma pe dok mol. <verse eid="2KI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 4:7" />En odok cen bot Elica katito bote gin ma otime, ci en ogamo ni, “Cit i cat moonu wek icul banyani woko, wek in ki lutino awobeni wukonye ki mudonge.”<verse eid="2KI 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elica ki dako ma lalonyo me Cunem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 4:8" />Inino mo acel Elica ocito wa i Cunem kama dako mo ma lalonyo bedo iye; ci dakonu olege ni ocam bote. Lacen ikare ducu ma en wok ki kenyo, en onongo ngak kong camo kunu. <verse eid="2KI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 4:9" />Dakonu owaco bot cware ni, “Nen ba, atyeko niang ada ni dano man ma limowa kany kare ki kareni en dano maleng pa Lubanga. <verse eid="2KI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 4:10" />Wek wager latin kicika mo iwi ot goropa kany, ci waket iye kitanda mo pire ki meja, kom, ki mac tara, wek ka en bino botwa, ci bedo iye.”<verse eid="2KI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 4:11" />Inino mo acel, Elica ocito kunu ci odonyo malo i kicikane kayweyo. <verse eid="2KI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 4:12" />Ci owaco bot latice Gekaji ni, “Cit ilwong dako ma Lacunem wek obin bota.” Ka obino, <verse eid="2KI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 4:13" />ci Elica owaco ki Gekaji ni, “Wac bot dakonu ni, Nen, in dong i yele pirwa mada ka gwokowa; dong gin ango ma imitoni myero atim piri? In itye ki lok mo ma imito atit bot rwot nyo ladit maloyo mony?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:13">En ogamo ni, “An atye gira maber dok abedo ikin lutuwa, dong pe tye gin mo ma abimito ki botwu.”<verse eid="2KI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 4:14" />Ci Elica openyo Gekaji ni, “Dong gin ango ma atwero timo pire?” Ci Gekaji ogamo ni, “En pe tye ki wode mo, ki cware bene dong otii woko.”<verse eid="2KI 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 4:15" />Ci Elica owaco bot Gekaji ni, “Lwonge wek obin kany.” Ka obino, ci ocung i dogola. <verse eid="2KI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 4:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:14">Aca 18:14</ref></char></note>Ci Elica owaco bote ni, “I mwaka mabino ikare onyo, ibitingo wodi ikori.” Ci dakonu ogamo ni, “Pe kumeno rwoda, pe i bwol angecani ba. In i dano pa Lubanga!” <verse eid="2KI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 4:17" />Ento dakonu ogamo ic, ci onywalo wode ikare meno kikome, i mwaka ma olubuni, kit macalo yam Elica owaco bote.<verse eid="2KI 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 4:18" />I nge mwaka manok, inino mo acel latin meno oa ocito bot wone ikin lukac. <verse eid="2KI 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 4:19" />Ma pud tye kunu ci ocako kok bot wone ni, “Ai, wiya do, wiya do!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:19">Ci wone owaco bot latice ni, “Tinge itere bot mine.” <verse eid="2KI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 4:20" />Ka otinge ci otere bot mine. Latin obedo i em mine nio i dyeceng amac, ci oto woko. <verse eid="2KI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 4:21" />Ci dakonu oa ocito opyele iwi kitanda pa dano pa Lubangani, ka oloro wiye woko i ot, ci okato woko. <verse eid="2KI 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 4:22" />Ka olwongo cware, ci owaco bote ni, “Cwala latici mo acel ki kana acel, wek acit bot dano pa Lubanga oyotoyot, ka adwogi.” <verse eid="2KI 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 4:23" />Ci cware ogamo ni, “Pingo i cito bote tin? Pien dwe peya opor, kadi Cabit bene pud.” Ento en ogamo ni, “Bibedo ber ka itimo kit ma alegi dok ayela mo bibedo peke.” <verse eid="2KI 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 4:24" />Ka kitweyo kom inge kana, ci dakonu owaco bot latice ni, “Wek kana oring, pe icung nio ka awaco ni cung.” <verse eid="2KI 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 4:25" />Ci gua me cito bot dano pa Lubanga wa i got Karmel. Ka dano pa Lubanga oneno en bino, ci owaco bot latice Gekaji ni, “Nen, Lacunem ca binoni! <verse eid="2KI 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 4:26" />Ring oyot icit irom kwede, ci ipenye ni, Itye maber? Cwari tye maber? Latin tye maber?” Ci dakonu ogamo ni, “Tye maber.” <verse eid="2KI 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 4:27" />Ka obino iwi got bot dano pa Lubanga, ci opoto omako tyene. Ci Gekaji obino ka cwale woko cen. Ento dano pa Lubanga ojuke ni, “Wek en obedi, pien tye ki can madwong i cwinye; ento Rwot okano loke woko ki bota, pe onyuta.” <verse eid="2KI 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 4:28" />Ci dako Lacunem owaco bote ni, “An yam alegi pi latin laco mo, rwoda? Yam pe awaco ni pe i bwola?” <verse eid="2KI 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 4:29" />Ci Elica owaco bot Gekaji ni, “A malo, itwe pyeri, ci ikwany odoona imak i cingi, wek icit. Ka iromo ki dano mo, pe imote; ka dano mo omoti, pe igam doge; cit iket odoona ipyel ikom latin.” <verse eid="2KI 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 4:30" />Min latin dok owaco ni, “Akwongo kwong ki nying Rwot matye makwoni, dok akwongo bene ki nying in kikomi ma i tye makwoni, ni an pe abibwoto in,” Ci gin aryoni bene gua ci gulubu kor Gekaji. <verse eid="2KI 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 4:31" />Gekaji ocito mere anyim, ci oketo odo ikom latin, ento gin mo pe otime kadi wa kit gin ma nyutu ni kwo. Omiyo odok cen ka romo kwede i yoo, ci otito bote ni, “Latin peya oco.”<verse eid="2KI 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 4:32" />Ka Elica obino i ot, ci oneno latin obutu iwi kitandane ma oto woko. <verse eid="2KI 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 4:33" />En odonyo oloro dogola woko iwigi gin aryo, ci ocako lego Rwot. <verse eid="2KI 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 4:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:21">1 Luk 17:21</ref></char></note>Dok oa malo ocito obutu ikom latin, kun keto doge i dog latin, ki wange bene oketo iwang latin, ki bade bene opyelo i bad latin, kun ryene ikome, ci kom latin odoko lyet. <verse eid="2KI 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 4:35" />Dok oa malo, ocako wot kun wire i dye ot tungi ki tungi, ka oryene dok ikome; ci latin ojiro tyen abiro, ci oyabo wange. <verse eid="2KI 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 4:36" />Ka olwongo Gekaji owaco bote ni, “Cit ilwong Lacunem man.” Ka obino bote, ci owaco ni, “Gam wodi eno.” <verse eid="2KI 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 4:37" />Ci dakonu obino opoto katyene, orumu conge piny i ngom, otingo latine ci okato woko.<verse eid="2KI 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elica otiyo tango pi lunebi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 4:38" />Ikare mo ma onongo kec opoto i lobo, Elica dok ocito i Gilgal. Ka yam tye kapwonyo lwak lunebi, ci owaco bot latice ni, “Cib agulu madit i keno, wek ited dek ki lwak lunebini.” <verse eid="2KI 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2KI 4:39" />Ngat acel ocito i poto ka ngwedo dek, ci onongo agaba me tim, opwono nyige pong kanyi ma odolo, ci obino ongwero oketo i agulu dek kun pe ngeyo kitgi. <verse eid="2KI 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="2KI 4:40" />Ka kitoko wek jonu gucam, ka gitye kacamo dek meno, ci gudange matek ni, “Ai dano pa Lubanga, yat to aye tye i aguluni!” Ci camone oloyogi woko. <verse eid="2KI 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="2KI 4:41" />Ci Elica ogamo ni, “Wukel moko kwon.” Ci oonyo i agulu, kun waco ni, “Tok dek ki jonu gucam.” Ci gin marac mo pe dok onen i agulu.<verse eid="2KI 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2KI 4:42" />Inino mukene dok Laco mo onongo oa ki i Baal-calica, okelo mugati me wi mwaka bot dano pa Lubanga, mugati cayiri pyere aryo, ki wit ngano manyen i kicaane. Ci Elica owaco ni, “Mii ki jonu wek gucam.” <verse eid="2KI 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="2KI 4:43" />Ento latice ogamo ni, “Man abiketo inyim jo miya aceli ningning?” En onwoyo waco ni, “Mii bot jonu, wek gucam, pien Rwot aye owaco kuman ni, ‘Gibicamo ci gibiweko mogo dong.’” <verse eid="2KI 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="2KI 4:44" />Ci oketo inyimgi, gucamo, guweko mogo odong, kit macalo Rwot owaconi.<verse eid="2KI 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2KI 5" />
  <para style="s1">Elica ocango dobo pa Naaman</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 4:27">Luk 4:27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Naaman, ladit me mony me Ciria, en yam dano madit inyim rwode dok bene onongo miye woro mada, pien Rwot omiyo Ciria obedo kaloyo lweny pi Naaman. En yam twon oteka lweny madit, ento onongo en ladobo. <verse eid="2KI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 5:2" />Ikare mukato angec onongo mony pa jo Ciria oyako latin nyako mo ki i lobo Icrael, ci odoko angeca pa dako pa Naaman. <verse eid="2KI 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 5:3" />Inino mo acel, anyakanu owaco bot min ot pa Naaman ni, “Kono nene rwoda tye cok ki lanebi matye i Camaria ca, kono ocango two dobone woko.” <verse eid="2KI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 5:4" />Kitmeno omiyo Naaman ocito otito bot rwot ni, “Angeca ma oa ki i lobo Icrael owaco kuman.” <verse eid="2KI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 5:5" />Ci rwot me Ciria ogamo ni, “Cit dong, an abicwalo waraga bot rwot me Icrael.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 5:5">Ka Naaman oa me cito, ci okwanyo ryal maromo talanta apar, ki jabu maromo cekel alip abicel, ki bongi mabeco apar. <verse eid="2KI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 5:6" />Ci okelo waraga bot rwot me Icrael, ma kwane kit man ni, “Ka waraga man oo boti, ber inge ni acwalo latica Naaman boti, wek in icang two dobone.” <verse eid="2KI 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 5:7" />Ka rwot me Icrael okwano waraganu, ci oyeco bongone kun waco ni, “An aye Lubanga bo, ma neko dano ka dok cero wokoni, en aye omiyo dano man ocwalo lok bota pi cango two dobo pa laco man? Kong wutam, ka dok wunen ni en tye kayenyo kolo ikoma.”<verse eid="2KI 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 5:8" />Ento ka Elica ma dano pa Lubanga owinyo ni rwot me Icrael oyeco bongone woko, ci ocwalo lok bot rwot kun waco ni, “Pingo i yeco bongoni woko? Wek en obin bota kombedi, wek onge ni lanebi tye i Icrael.” <verse eid="2KI 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 5:9" />Kitmeno Naaman ocito bote ki aguragurane ducu ki gadigadi monye, ci ocung i dogola ot pa Elica. <verse eid="2KI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 5:10" />Ci Elica ocwalo latice bote kun wace ni, “Cit i lwoke i kulu Jordan tyen abiro, ci ibicang, dok komi biroc dok kakare.” <verse eid="2KI 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 5:11" />Ento kiniga omako Naaman, ci oa woko me cito kun waco ni, “Nen, onongo atamo ni en bia bino bota, ka cung ci lwongo nying Rwot Lubangane, ka ilo cinge ikoma, kacango two dobona woko. <verse eid="2KI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 5:12" />Kulu Abana ki Parpar ma gitye i Damaciko gibeco makato lwak pii matye i Icrael ducu! Ka onongo nene alwoke i piigi kono koma pe ocang woko?” Ci oa woko me dok cen ki kiniga madwong. <verse eid="2KI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 5:13" />Ento lutice gunyiko bote cok, ci guwace ni, “A, ladit, ka onongo lanebi owaco ni i tim gin mo matek makato man kono pe itiyo? Pingo pe icit ilwoke kit ma en owaconi wek komi ocang woko?” <verse eid="2KI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 5:14" />Ci Naaman oa ocito olwoke i kulu Jordan tyen abiro, kit ma dano pa Lubanga owaconi; ci ocang, kome oroc odok kakare macalo kom latin lakere. <verse eid="2KI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 5:15" />Ci Naaman oloke odok cen bot Elica kacel ki lutice ducu, ci obino ocung inyime, kun waco ni, “Nen, an dong angeyo ni Lubanga mo pe i lobo ducu, kono i Icrael keken; ber dong igam mot pa latici.”<verse eid="2KI 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 5:16" />Ento Elica owace ni, “Akwongo kwong ki nying Rwot matye makwoni, ni pe abigamo gin mo ki boti.” Naaman obedo kadiyo en ni ogam, ento Elica okwero woko. <verse eid="2KI 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 5:17" />Ci Naaman owaco bote ni, “Ka ikwero, ci alegi ni, wek ki miya lobo ma kana aryo gitwero yeyo, pien nia tin, rwoda, pe abityero gitum awanga nyo gitum mukene bot lubanga mo, kono bot Rwot Lubanga keken. <verse eid="2KI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 5:18" />Piman, kace abicito kacel ki ladita nino jwi i ot pa Rimmon ma en lubanga me Ciria, ma kun nongo en kule piny kawore, ci an myero bene akule i ot pa Rimmon, ci Rwot myero otima kica ikom lok man.” <verse eid="2KI 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 5:19" />Ci Elica owace ni, “Dong icit ki kuc.” Ci Naaman oa odok cen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 5:19">Ento ka Naaman peya owoto ocito mabor, <verse eid="2KI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 5:20" />ci Gekaji latic pa Elica ma dano pa Lubangani owaco ni, “Nen, rwoda oweko Naaman Laciriani ocito labongo cul mo. En onongo myero oye mic ma Laciriani okelo! Akwongo kwong ki nying Rwot matye makwoni, ni abiringo i kore, wek anong gin mo ki bote.” <verse eid="2KI 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 5:21" />Kitmeno Gekaji oringo olubu kor Naaman. Ka Naaman oneno kiringo i kore, ci opye piny ki iwi gadigadine pi rwate kwede ci openyo ni, “Lok mo tye?” <verse eid="2KI 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 5:22" />Ci Gekaji ogamo ni, “Lok mo peke. Rwoda ocwala ni awac boti ni, ‘Kombedi awobe aryo mogo ma gin lunebi gubino bota ma gua wa i lobo godi me Epraim; alego ni, imii botgi talanta me ryal ki bongo aryo mabeco.’ <verse eid="2KI 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 5:23" />Ci Naaman ogamo ni, Ber igam talanta aryo.” Dok orido en matek, omiyo otweyo talanta aryo me ryal i kicaa aryo, ki bongo aryo mabeco, ci omiyo lutice aryo gutingo gutelo nyim Gekaji. <verse eid="2KI 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 5:24" />Ka oo iwi cere, ci okwanyo woko ki i cinggi, ci oketogi i ot; ka ocwalo jo meno woko, ci gucito. <verse eid="2KI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 5:25" />Ka odonyo i ot, ci Elica openye ni, “Gekaji in ia ki kwene?” Ci en ogamo doge ni, “Latici pe ocito kamo.” <verse eid="2KI 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 5:26" />Ento Elica owace ni, “Tipu koma ocito kwedi wa ikare ma laconi olor piny ki iwi aguragurane pi lok kwedi. Man pe obedo kare me gamo lim ki ginarukagu, ki poto jeituni ki poto olok, ki romi ki twonigu ki opii ki angecagu. <verse eid="2KI 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 5:27" />Pi gin man ma i timoni, dobo pa Naaman bikobo ikom in, ki ikom likwayi matwal.” Kitmeno en okato woko ki inyime ma ladobo, ma kome orugu woko matar macalo pee.<verse eid="2KI 5:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2KI 6" />
  <para style="s1">Kinongo latong ma opoto i pii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 6:1" />Inino mo acel lwak pa lunebi gukok bot Elica ni, “Nen, kabedo ma wabedo iye me cokewa dong tidi mo, pe romowa. <verse eid="2KI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 6:2" />Wek wacit i Jordan wek dano acel acel onong yat ki kunu, wek wayub kabedo me cokewa mukene.” Ci Elica ogamo ni, “Citu.” <verse eid="2KI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 6:3" />Dano mo acel ma ikin gi olege ni ocit kwedgi, ci en oye me cito. <verse eid="2KI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 6:4" />Ci en oa me cito kwedgi. Ka guo i Jordan, gutongo yadi mapol. <verse eid="2KI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 6:5" />Ento ka dano mo acel tye katongo yat, ci latonge oput woko ci opoto i pii, ci odange matek ni, “Maa do, rwoda! Pien alego latong man alega.” <verse eid="2KI 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 6:6" />Ci Elica openye ni, “Opoto kakwene?” Ka onyute kakare, ci Elica otongo jang yat mo, ci obolo i pii kunu, omiyo latong okwang iwi pii. <verse eid="2KI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 6:7" />Ci Elica owaco bote ni, “Kwany woko ki i pii.” Ci laconu ocwalo cinge ka okwanyo latong.<verse eid="2KI 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elica ki mony pa jo Ciria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 6:8" />Ikare mo rwot me Ciria onongo tye kalweny ikom Icrael. Ka openyo ludito monye ci guyero kama omyero gugony i ye. <verse eid="2KI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 6:9" />Ento Elica onongo cwalo lok bot rwot me Icrael ni, “Pe i wok ki ka munyo, pien jo Ciria gugony i ye dok gitye ka kuruwu wek gipot ki lweny ikomwu kunu.” <verse eid="2KI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 6:10" />Ci miyo rwot me Icrael cwalo dano i kabedonu ka ciko jo ma kunu wek gubed atera. Man otime tyen mapol.<verse eid="2KI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 6:11" />Omiyo cwiny rwot me Ciria obale woko; ci olwongo ludito monye ci owaco botgi ni, “Anga matye ikinwa ma tucu yubwa woko bot rwot me Icrael?” <verse eid="2KI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 6:12" />Ci ladit monye mo acel owaco bote ni. “Meno pe wan rwot; ento Elica ma lanebi matye i Icrael, en aye tito lok ma i loko kadiwa i kicika butuni bot rwot me Icrael.” <verse eid="2KI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 6:13" />Ci rwot me Ciria ogamo ni, “Cit iyeny kama en tye iye, wek acwal dano kamake.” Ka kitite ni en tye wa i Dotan, <verse eid="2KI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 6:14" />ci ocwalo lwak aguragura ki gadigadi lweny ki mony madit; ci gucito wa kunu i dyewor, gurumu taun meno woko.<verse eid="2KI 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 6:15" />Orwone, ka latic pa Elica oa malo odiko con okato woko, ci oneno mony ki aguragura ki gadigadi lweny orumu taun woko ducu. Ci odok cen i ot ci okok bot Elica ni, “Maa do, rwoda! Man watimo ango?” <verse eid="2KI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 6:16" />Elica odoke iye ni, “Pe ilwor, pien jo matye tung botwa dwong makato jo matye tung botgi.” <verse eid="2KI 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 6:17" />Ci Elica olego kun waco ni, “Ai Rwot, alegi, yab wang latica wek onen.” Ci Rwot oyabo wang latin awobi meno, ci oneno aguragura opongo wi got woko ki gadigadi lweny me mac ma orumu Elica woko dyere. <verse eid="2KI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 6:18" />Ka Luciria gucito kalweny ikome, ci Elica olego Rwot kun waco ni, “Alegi ni dong imii wang jo magi ocor woko.” Ci Rwot omiyo wanggi ocor woko kit macalo Elica olegoni. <verse eid="2KI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 6:19" />Ci Elica owaco botgi ni, “Man pe yoo ma atir, dok man bene pe taun ma wun wuyenyoni; wulub kora, wek aterwu bot dano ma wuyenyoni.” Ci oterogi wa i Camaria.<verse eid="2KI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 6:20" />Ka gudonyo i Camaria, ci Elica olego Rwot ni, “Ai Rwot, dong i yab wang jo magi, wek gunen piny.” Ci Rwot oyabo wanggi, ci nen; gunongo ni gitye wa i dye Camaria. <verse eid="2KI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 6:21" />Ka rwot me Icrael onenogi, ci openyo Elica ni, “Wora, abinekgi woko? Abinekgi woko?” <verse eid="2KI 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 6:22" />Ci En ogamo ni, “Pe inekgi. Ka lumony ma meri gumako lumoneni ki i dog lweny, in pe iketo cingi ikomgi me nekogi. Ket cam ki pii inyimgi, wek gucam, gumat, ka gudok bot rwotgi.” <verse eid="2KI 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 6:23" />En oyubu pirgi cam madwong; ka dong gucamo, gumato, ci ocwalogi gudok bot rwotgi. Ci jo Ciria pe dok gudwogo kamonyo lobo Icrael matwal.<verse eid="2KI 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rumu Camaria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 6:24" />Lacen Ben-adad rwot me Ciria ocoko monye ducu, ocito orumu Camaria. <verse eid="2KI 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 6:25" />Pimeno, kec madit opoto i Camaria nio ka wi kana ma mwani onongo dong ki cato pi cekel me ryal pyere aboro kulu, ki cet amam<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:25 </char><char style="fk">Cet amam </char> man pe obedo cet amam, ento nying ma onongo kilwongo ki gin meno ma onongo dano cayo tutwal, ento pi kec madit omiyo kibedo kacatone pi cekel me ryal abic. Gwok nyo obedo pot muranga mutwo onyo nyig yat mo ma i lum ata.</note> bakuli acel kiwilo ki cekel me ryal abic. <verse eid="2KI 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 6:26" />Inino mo acel ma rwot me Icrael onongo tye kawot kun kato ki iwi cel me taun, ci dako mo odange ki lok bote, kun waco ni, “Konya do rwoda!” <verse eid="2KI 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 6:27" />Ci en ogamo ni, “Ka Rwot pe okonyi, ci an abinongo gin ma akonyi kwede kwene? Onongo an atye ki ngano nyo kongo bwino bo me wek akonyi kwede?”<verse eid="2KI 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 6:28" />Ci rwot openye ni, “Gin ango ma yeli?” Ci dakonu ogamo ni, “Dako man owaca ni, ‘Mii wodi wek tin wacam, ka diki dong wabicamo woda.’ <verse eid="2KI 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 6:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:57">Nwo 28:57</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 4:10">Kok 4:10</ref></char></note>Ci omiyo watedo woda wacamo. Orwone awaco ki dakonu ni dong okel wode wek wacam, ento en okano wode woko.” <verse eid="2KI 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 6:30" />Ka rwot owinyo lok pa dakonu, ci oyeco bongine woko ducu me nyutu cwercwinye, ci dano gunenoni en onongo oruku bongo cola ki ite bongone. <verse eid="2KI 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 6:31" />Ci rwot owaco ni, “Lubanga owek to ocoba woko tin, kace pe aneko Elica ma piny peya oyutu. Pien en aye omiyo can ma kit man opoto ikomwa!”<verse eid="2KI 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 6:32" />Elica onongo obedo i ode, kacel ki ludongo ma gubino kalime. Ikare meno onongo rwot ocwalo dano kalwongo Elica. Ento ma pud peya lakwena oo bote, Elica owaco bot ludongo ni, “Wungeyo wunu ni laneko ma en rwot me Icrael ocwalo dano me neka woko? Ka lakwenanu obino, ci wulor dogola woko, wumak dogola matek liking, pe wuwek odony i ot. En rwot kikome bene bibedo kalubu kor lakwenanu macok.” <verse eid="2KI 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 6:33" />Ikare ma en pud loko kwedgi, ci nen, rwot gin ki lakwenanu gutugi o, ci owaco ni, “Peko man oa ki bot Rwot Lubanga! Pingo dok pud amede kakuru kony ki bote?”<verse eid="2KI 6:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2KI 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 7:1" />Ento Elica owaco bote ni, “Winy lok pa Rwot Lubanga: En waco kuman ni, ‘Diki kare onyo kibicato moko kwon mapwote adita acel pi cekel acel, ki cayiri adita aryo kibicato pi cekel acel ki i dog gang me Camaria.’” <verse eid="2KI 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 7:2" />Ci ladit me acikari makonyo rwot ogamo dog Elica kun waco ni, “Kadi bed Rwot Lubanga kikome aye biyabo wang dirica ki i polo, ci meno pe bitime” Ci Elica ogamo ni, “In ibineno ki wangi, ento pe ibicamone.”<verse eid="2KI 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lworo madit opoto ikom mony me Ciria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 7:3" />I ninonu onongo tye ludobo angwen ma gibedo i dog gang me Camaria, ci gubedo kapenye keken gi ni, “Wan wabibedo kany kit man nio ka wato? <verse eid="2KI 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 7:4" />Kadi wawac ni, ‘Wadonyu i gang,’ kec bene tye i gang, ci wabito ki kunu; ka wabedo kany bene, wabito woko. Dong wubin, wacitu kombedi wa i gony pa jo Ciria. Ka pe gunekowa ci wabikwo, ka gunekowa ci wabito.” <verse eid="2KI 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 7:5" />Ci jonu gua ma piny dong cidoni, ci gucito wa i gony pa jo Ciria; ento ka guo i dog gony pa jo Ciria ci nen, dano mo onongo peke kunu. <verse eid="2KI 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 7:6" />Pien Rwot onongo omiyo jo Ciria guwinyo dwon lwak gadigadi lweny, ki pa aguragura, ki dwon mony madwong, ci guloko ikin gi keken gi ni, “Nen, rwot me Icrael owilo mony pa rwot pa jo Kit ki luker me Ejipt me bino kalweny ikomwa.” <verse eid="2KI 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 7:7" />Omiyo gutware woko ki ngwec i otyeno meno pi laro kwogi, ci guweko kemagi, ki aguraguragi, ki kanagi i gony ki bere.<verse eid="2KI 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 7:8" />Ka ludobo meno guo i dog gony, ci gudonyo i kema mo, gucamo, gumato, ci gutingo ryal mogo ki jabu ki bongigu, gucito gukanogi woko; ka dok gudwogo cen, gudonyo i kema mukene bene, gutingo jami matye iye, gucito gukano. <verse eid="2KI 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 7:9" />Ento guloko keken gi ni, “Gin ma watimoni pe ber. Tin aye nino me kwena maber; ka waling nio ka piny odoko leng, ci can bipoto ikomwa; dong wubin, wacitu wek wacitit bot jo ma i ot pa rwot.” <verse eid="2KI 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 7:10" />Ci gucito gulwongo lugwok dog gang, ka gutito botgi ni, “Wan wacito wa i gony pa jo Ciria, ci nen, pe wanongo dano, pe bene wawinyo gin mo kunu dok bene gin mo pe, kono lwak aguragura ki lwak kana keken ma kitweyogi, ki kema bene tye ma kiwekogi kibere.” <verse eid="2KI 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 7:11" />Ci lugwok dogcel gudange ki dwon matek, ci gutito pire bot lutic pa rwot. <verse eid="2KI 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 7:12" />Ci rwot oa malo i dyewor, owaco bot lutice ni, “Abitito ki wun kit ma jo Ciria guyube kwede kalweny ikomwa. Gin gingeyo ni watye ki kec; omiyo guweko gonygi ci gucito woko kakane wa i bar. Gin mitoni, wan wakat woko ki i taun madit wek wacit kanongo cam ci gibimakowa woko makwo ka dok bene gibimako taunwa madit woko.” <verse eid="2KI 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 7:13" />Ci Latice mo acel ogamo ni, “Kong ki cwal jo mogo ki aguragura abic i ikin mewa mudongi wek kinen kite, pien ka wan ducu ma pud wakwoni wadong kany ci bene wabito macalo lwak jo Icrael ducu madong guto gutum wokoni.” <verse eid="2KI 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 7:14" />Ci gukwanyo co ma gin lungwec ki aguragura, ci rwot ocwalogi ki gadigadi aryo wek gucit kaneno gin mutime ikom mony pa jo Ciria. <verse eid="2KI 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 7:15" />Ci jonu gucito gulubu korgi wa i Jordan; ci gunongo jami mapol ata ma mony me Ciria gubolo i korayo pi laro komgi. Ci lukwena gudwogo cen gutito bot rwot.<verse eid="2KI 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 7:16" />Ci jo Camaria gumol gucito kayako gony pa jo Ciria, ci adita acel me moko kwon mapwote ki cato pi cekel acel, ki adita aryo me cayiri pi cekel acel, kit mayam Rwot owaconi. <verse eid="2KI 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 7:17" />Ikare meno onongo rwot oketo ladit me acikari ma konyeni aye me bedo lagwok dog gang; ento ka en ocung i dog gang, ka dano gutware me kato woko ci gunyone, ci oto woko, kit ma Elica owaco ikare ma rwot ocito boteni. <verse eid="2KI 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 7:18" />Pien ka Elica onongo owaco bot rwot ni, “Diki ka onyo adita aryo me cayiri ki biwilo ki cekel acel, ki adita me moko kwon mapwote pi cekel acel, i dog gang me Camaria,” <verse eid="2KI 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 7:19" />ci ladit me acikari ogamo dog Elica ni, “Kadi bed Rwot Lubanga kikome aye biyabo wang dirica ki i polo, ci meno pe bitime.” Ci Elica ogamo ni, “In ki komi ibineno ki wangi, ento pe ibicamone.” <verse eid="2KI 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 7:20" />Ci otime ikome kitmeno, pien dano gunyone ki tyen gi ki i dog gang ci oto woko.<verse eid="2KI 7:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2KI 8" />
  <para style="s1">Kidwoko lobo pa dako me Cunem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 8:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 4:8-37">2 Luk 4:8-37</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ikare meno Elica owaco ki dako me Cunem mayam ocero latineni ni, “A woko ki jo ma i odi wek icit ibed kamo keken ma i twero; pien Rwot ociko pi kec, ci bipoto i lobo pi mwaka abiro.” <verse eid="2KI 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 8:2" />Ci dakonu oa ocito kit ma Elica owaco; en ki jo ma i ode ci obedo i lobo pa jo Piliciti mwaka abiro. <verse eid="2KI 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 8:3" />Ka mwaka abiro otum, ci dakonu odwogo nia ki i lobo pa jo Piliciti, okato ocito bot rwot kakoko pi ode ki pi lobone wek kidwok cen bote. <verse eid="2KI 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 8:4" />Ikare ma en oo, onongo rwot tye kalok ki Gekaji ma latic pa dano pa Lubanga, kun waco bote ni, “Tita gin madito ducu madong Elica otyeko tiyo.” <verse eid="2KI 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 8:5" />Gekaji onongo tye katito bot rwot kit ma Elica ocero ki dano ma oto, ci nen, dako ma en ocero wodeni okok bot rwot pi ode ki pi lobone. Ci Gekaji owaco ni, “Rwot, man en aye dakoca, ki wode bene ene, ma Elica oceroni.” <verse eid="2KI 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 8:6" />Ka rwot openyo dakonu, ci en otite, omiyo rwot okwanyo dano mo madit pire, kun waco ni, “Dwok jami mayam pa dakonu ducu bote, kacel ki jami ma ocek i potine nia wa ikare ma en obwoto ki lobone nio kwede wa onyo.”<verse eid="2KI 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elica ki Ben-adad rwot me Ciria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 8:7" />Elica ocito i Damaciko ikare ma Ben-adad rwot me Ciria onongo two; ka ngat mo otito ki rwot ni, Elica obino kany, <verse eid="2KI 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 8:8" />ci rwot owaco bot Kajael ma ngat acel ki ikin ludito monye ni, “Kwany mot icit kwede kajolo wi Elica, ci ilege wek en openy dog Rwot kace abicang ki i two man.” <verse eid="2KI 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 8:9" />Kitmeno Kajael ocito kajolo Elica, ci otero mot ki kit kwayi jami ducu mabeco matye i Damaciko, ma kinaga pyere angwen guyeyo. Ka Kajael ocito ocung inyim Elica, ci owace ni, “Latici Ben-adad ma rwot me Ciria ocwala boti, kapenyo ka en bicang ki two man?” <verse eid="2KI 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 8:10" />Ci Elica ogamo ni, “Rwot otyeko nyutu bota ni en obito ada; ento cit iwac bote ni, en bicang ada.” <verse eid="2KI 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 8:11" />Ci Elica ociko wange ikom Kajael kun gaye kwede, nio ka lewic omako, ci Elica ocako koko. <verse eid="2KI 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 8:12" />Ci Kajael openyo ni, “Rwoda, dok ikok pingo ka?” Ci en ogamo ni, “Pien angeyo tim marac ma ibitimo ikom jo Icrael; ibiwango cel gogogi ma orumu taun madito woko ki mac, ibineko co matino woko ki pala lucwan, kun inyoto lutino lukere woko, dok mon gi ma giyac ibiryeko igi woko.”<verse eid="2KI 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 8:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 19:15">1 Luk 19:15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ci Kajael ogamo ni, “An ma mwani kono abinongo twero macalo meno ki kwene?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 8:13">Elica odok iye ni, “Rwot otyeko nyutu bota ni, in aye ibibedo rwot me Ciria.”<verse eid="2KI 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 8:14" />Kajael oa woko ki bot Elica, ci odok cen bot Ben-adad. Ben-adad openye ni, “Elica owaco boti lok ango?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 8:14">Ci en ogamo ni, “En otita ni in i bicang adada.” <verse eid="2KI 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 8:15" />Orwone Kajael okwanyo batania, olutu i pii ci oumu woko ki wange wek pe oywe nio ka oto. Kajael oleyo katyene.<verse eid="2KI 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Loc pa Jekoram me Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 21:1-20">2 Tek 21:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 8:16" />I mwaka me abic me ker pa Joram wod pa Akab rwot me Icrael, en aye Jekoram wod pa Yekocapat rwot me Juda ocako iye loc. <verse eid="2KI 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 8:17" />Jekoram ocamo ker ma onongo mwaka me dite tye pyere adek wiye aryo, ci obedo kaloc i Jerucalem pi mwaka aboro. <verse eid="2KI 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 8:18" />Ci en bene obedo kalubu kit pa luker me Icrael, kun tiyo gin manen marac iwang Rwot kit macalo jo me ot pa Akab gutiyo, pien dakone obedo nya pa Akab. <verse eid="2KI 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 8:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:36">1 Luk 11:36</ref></char></note>Ento Rwot pe omito tyeko Juda woko, pien con ocike bot latice Daudi me miyo likwaye me loc matwal.<verse eid="2KI 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 8:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 27:40">Aca 27:40</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ikare me loc pa Jekoram en aye jo Edom gujemo iye ikom Juda, ci guwiro rwotgi pirgi ken gi. <verse eid="2KI 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 8:21" />Ci Jekoram okato loka Jair kacel ki gadigadi lwenye ducu, ci jo Edom gurume dyere. Ento en ki ludito ma giloyo gadigadi lwenye gulwenyo ikomgi ki dyewor ci gubwot woko, ci monye guringo gudok paco. <verse eid="2KI 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 8:22" />Omiyo Edom ojemo woko ikom loc pa Juda nio wa onyo. Ka dok Libna bene ojemo i karenu.<verse eid="2KI 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 8:23" />Lok kom Jekoram mudonge ducu, ki gin mayam otiyo ducu, kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro pa Luker me Juda. </char> <verse eid="2KI 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 8:24" />Jekoram oto, oywe kacel ki kwarine, dok kiyike kacel ki kwarine i taun madit pa Daudi; Akajia ma wode aye oleyo katyene.<verse eid="2KI 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Loc pa Akajia rwot me Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 22:1-6">2 Tek 22:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 8:25" />I mwaka me apar wiye aryo me loc pa Joram wod pa Akab, rwot me Icrael, Akajia wod pa Jekoram, rwot me Juda, ocako camo iye ker. <verse eid="2KI 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 8:26" />Akajia onongo dite romo mwaka pyere aryo wiye aryo ka ocamo ker, ci obedo kaloc i Jerucalem pi mwaka acel. Mine nyinge Atalia; en yam lakwar Omri rwot me Icrael. <verse eid="2KI 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 8:27" />Akajia bene obedo kalubu kit pa jo me ot pa Akab, kun tiyo gin manen marac iwang Rwot, kit macalo jo me ot pa Akab ma jo pacone gubedo katiyone.<verse eid="2KI 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 8:28" />Akajia oribe gin ki Joram wod pa Akab kalweny ki Kajael rwot me Ciria wa i Ramot-gilead, ci jo Ciria guketo ret ikom Joram. <verse eid="2KI 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 8:29" />Ci odwogo i Jejreel kamado ret ma jo Ciria guketo ikome ki i Ramot-gilead, ci Akajia wod pa Jekoram rwot me Juda ocito kunu kalime.<verse eid="2KI 8:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2KI 9" />
  <para style="s1">Kiwiro Yeku me bedo rwot me Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 9:1" />Elica olwongo ngat acel ikin lwak pa lunebi ci owaco bote ni, “Yube me cito i Ramot-gilead. Kwany adomo moo jeituni man wek icit kwede. <verse eid="2KI 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 9:2" />Ka io kunu, ci icit iyeny Yeku wod pa Yekocapat, wod pa Nimci; cit i wace oa woko ki ikin luwote, ci i tere i kicika ma i tyelo. <verse eid="2KI 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 9:3" />Ka i kwany adomo moo, i ony iwiye, kun iwaco bote ni, ‘Rwot owaco kuman ni ewiro in me bedo rwot maloyo Icrael.’ Ka dong i yab dogola ci i lwi woko oyotoyot; pe i bed kunu.”<verse eid="2KI 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 9:4" />Ci awobi meno ma lanebini oa ocito i Ramot-gilead. <verse eid="2KI 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 9:5" />Ka oo kunu, ci onongo ludito me mony gubedo i kacokegi, ci owaco ni, “Ladit, atye ki kwena mo bot ngat acel ikinwu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:5">Ci Yeku ogamo ni, “I bino bot anga ki ikinwa kany?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:5">En ogamo ni, “Abino bot in ladit.” <verse eid="2KI 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 9:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:16">1 Luk 19:16</ref></char></note>Ci Yeku oa ocito kwede i ot; ci latin awobinu oonyo moo iwiye, kun waco bote ni, “Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael owaco kuman ni ewiro in me bedo rwot maloyo lwak pa Rwot, jo Icrael. <verse eid="2KI 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 9:7" />In aye i bityeko ot pa laditi Akab, wek acul kwor ikom Jejebel pi neko lunebina, ki lutic pa Rwot mukene ducu. <verse eid="2KI 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 9:8" />Pien ot pa Akab bitum woko ducu; abineko co woko ducu ki bot Akab, ma opii ki ma anywaligu, ma gitye i Icrael. <verse eid="2KI 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 9:9" />Abimiyo ot pa Akab bedo calo ot pa Jeroboam wod pa Nebat, dok bibedo macalo ot pa Baaca wod pa Akija. <verse eid="2KI 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 9:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:23">1 Luk 21:23</ref></char></note>Gwogi aye bimwodo kom Jejebel woko ki i lobo Jejreel, ngat mo pe biyiko en.” Ka awobi meno ma lanebini otyeko loko magi ducu, ci oyabo dogola opuce ci oringo woko.<verse eid="2KI 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 9:11" />Ka Yeku okato woko bot ludito luwote, gupenye ni, “Lok ango dong? Pingo lapoyanu obino boti?” Ci en owaco botgi ni, “Wun wungeyo kit lok ma awobe ma lunebi loko do.” <verse eid="2KI 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 9:12" />Ci guwaco ni, “Meno goba; tuc lok ma en otito kikome.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:12">Ci en otito botgi ki kore ni, “En oloko bota ni Rwot owaco kuman ni, ‘Awiro in me bedo rwot maloyo Icrael.’” <verse eid="2KI 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 9:13" />Cutcut ngat acel acel okwanyo bongone oyotoyot opeto piny i rwom ma obedo gotgot wek en obed iye, ci gucako kutu tumgi kun gidange matek ni, “Yeku aye rwot!”<verse eid="2KI 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 9:14" />Kitmeno Yeku wod pa Yekocapat wod pa Nimci ocako piro lok ikom Joram. (I karenu onongo Joram ki jo Icrael ducu gubedo kagwoko Ramot-gilead pi gengo Kajael rwot me Ciria wek pe olweny ikome; <verse eid="2KI 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 9:15" />ento onongo rwot Joram otyeko dwogo i Jejreel kamado ret mayam jo Ciria guketo ikome, ikare ma onongo en olwenyo ki Kajael rwot me Ciria.) Ci Yeku owaco ni, “Kace tamwu tye kit man, pe wuwek dano mo opuce ki i taun kany katero lok man i Jejreel.” <verse eid="2KI 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 9:16" />Ci Yeku oito iwi gadigadi lwenye, me cito wa i Jejreel, pien onongo Joram tye kamado rete kunu. Ka dok Akajia rwot me Juda bene tye kunu kalimo Joram.<verse eid="2KI 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 9:17" />Inino meno onongo lakurpiny mo ocung malo i lubele ma i Jejreel, ci oneno buca mony pa Yeku ka tye kabino, ci owaco ni, “Aneno buca mony.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:17">Ci Joram owaco ki monye ni, “Kwany won aguragura mo, i cwale wek ocit orwate kwede ci openye ni, ‘I bino ki kuc bo?’”<verse eid="2KI 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 9:18" />Ci lakwena oito iwi aguragura ocito karwate kwede, ci openye ni, “Rwot openyo ni, ‘I bino ki kuc bo?’” Ci Yeku ogamo ni, “In iyele kapenyo pi kuc pingo ka? Loke ilub kora.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:18">Ci lakurpiny odwoko lok kun waco ni, “Lakwena oo kunu, ento pe tye kadwogo.” <verse eid="2KI 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 9:19" />Dok ocwalo won aguragura me aryone. Ka oo botgi ci owace ni, “Rwot openyo ni, ‘I bino ki kuc bo?’” Yeku ogamo ni, “In iyele kapenyo pi kuc pingo? Loke, ilub kora.”<verse eid="2KI 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 9:20" />Lakurpiny dok odwoko lok ni, “En oo botgi, ci pe dong tye kadwogo. Dok laryem gadigadi lweny ryemo macalo Yeku wod pa Nimci; pien ryemo ki tek tutwal calo lapoya.”<verse eid="2KI 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 9:21" />Ci Joram owaco ni, “Wuyub gadigadina!” Ci ki yubu gadigadine, ka Joram gin ki Akajia rwot me Juda guito iwi gadigadigi, gucito karwate ki Yeku. Gurwate kwede i poto pa Nabot ma jo Jejreel. <verse eid="2KI 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 9:22" />Ka Joram oneno Yeku, ci openyo ni, “I bino ki kuc bo?” En ogamo ni, “Kuc ango ma dok tye, ma kun timwu me woro lubangagu ki tim jokjok pa meni Jejebel dong dwong tutwali?”<verse eid="2KI 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 9:23" />Ci Joram odange matek kun waco ni, “Roro dong ocake woko Akajia!” Ci owiro gadigadine me ngwec woko. <verse eid="2KI 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 9:24" />Ento Yeku otelo atume ki teke ducu, ci obayo ocelo Joram ikin akwaya bade, ci ocobo wa ikom adunune, omiyo en opoto piny ki iwi gadigadine naka wa i to. <verse eid="2KI 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 9:25" />Ci Yeku owaco bot Bidkar ma lakony en ni, “Kwany kome wek i bole woko i poto pa Nabot ma jo Jejreel. Po pi lok ma Rwot yam otito ikome ikare ma an ki in onongo waringo ki aguragurawa kacel i kor Akab ma wone kun waco ni, <verse eid="2KI 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 9:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:19">1 Luk 21:19</ref></char></note>‘Macalo laworo aneno remo pa Nabot, ki remo pa awobeneni, abiculu kwor ikomi i poto man bene! Man lok pa Rwot kikome.’ Dong i tinge i bole i poto kany, kun i lubu lok mayam Rwot owaconi.”<verse eid="2KI 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeku oneko Akajia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 22:7-9">2 Tek 22:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 9:27" />Ka Akajia rwot me Juda oneno, ci oringo woko odok tung taun me Bet-kagan, ento Yeku olubu kore ci owaco ki monye ni, “Wunek en bene!” Ci kicele woko ki iwi gadigadine kun tye kaito cere ma woto i Gur, macok ki i taun me Ibleam. Ci oringo olaro Megiddo, kama oto iye. <verse eid="2KI 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 9:28" />Ci lutice gutingo en ki gadigadi gutere i Jerucalem, ci guyike i lyele kacel ki kwarine i taun madit pa Daudi.<verse eid="2KI 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 9:29" />Onongo Akajia ocako loyo jo Juda i mwaka me apar wiye acel me loc pa Joram ma wod pa Akab.<verse eid="2KI 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">To pa daker Jejebel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 9:30" />Ka daker Jejebel owinyoni Yeku oo i Jejreel, ci owero teng wange ryoryo ki rangi macol, oyubu wiye, ci ocung kun neno woko ki iwang dirica. <verse eid="2KI 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 9:31" />Ka Yeku donyo ki i dog gang, ci Jejebel openyo ni, “Ibino ki kuc bo in lanekoni? In i calo Jimri, ma oneko rwodeni.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nen 1 Luk 16:9-10, ma Jimri oneko rwode, Rwot Ela. </char></note><verse eid="2KI 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 9:32" />Ci Yeku oilo wiye malo ka oneno dirica, ci owaco ni, “Anga matye tung bota? Anga?” Co aryo nyo adek ma lugwok daker, ma kikologi, guneno tung bote. <verse eid="2KI 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 9:33" />Ci Yeku owaco botgi ni, “Wubole woko piny!” Ci gubolo Jejebel woko piny, ci remone okir i kor ot ki ikom aguragura. Ci Yeku oringo ikome ki aguragura ci gunyono kome woko atata. <verse eid="2KI 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 9:34" />Ci Yeku odonyo i otker, ocamo ka omato. Lacen owaco ni, “Wukwany kom dako man ma kicenoni wek wuyike woko, pien en nya pa rwot.” <verse eid="2KI 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 9:35" />Ka gucito kayiko kome, ci pe gunongo gin mo mudong ikome, kono nyo olar wiye ki tyene aryo ki opany cinge aryo keken. <verse eid="2KI 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 9:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:23">1 Luk 21:23</ref></char></note>Ka gudwogo bote, gutite, ci ogamo ni, “Meno en aye lok pa Rwot, mayam owaco ki i dog Eliya Laticbe ni, ‘Gwogi aye bimwodo kom Jejebel ki i lobo me Jejreel; <verse eid="2KI 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 9:37" />dok kom Jejebel bibedo macalo cet dyang ma kiketo ata i ngom i poto ma i lobo Jejreel, ma bimiyo dano mo pe twero waco ni, man aye Jejebel.’”<verse eid="2KI 9:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2KI 10" />
  <para style="s1">Yeku oneko jo me ot pa Akab otyeko woko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 10:1" />Onongo Akab tye ki awobene pyere abiro ma gibedo i Camaria. Ci Yeku ocoyo waraga mogo, ci ocwalogi i Camaria bot ludito ma giloyo taun meno, ki bot ludongo, ki bot lugwok lutino awobe pa Akab, kun waco ni, <verse eid="2KI 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 10:2" />“Lutino pa rwotwu tye botwu, dok bene wutye ki gadigadi lweny ki aguraguragu, ki taun gi ma kirumu ki cel gogo, ki jami lwenygu. Dong kace waraga man oo botwu, <verse eid="2KI 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 10:3" />wuyer latin ker ma opore mucwiny maber maromo loc ki ikin lutino awobe pa rwotwu, ci wuket iwi komker pa wone, ka dong wulweny pi ot pa rwotwu.” <verse eid="2KI 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 10:4" />Ento gubedo ki lworo matek, ci guwaco ni, “Nen ba, ka luker aryo ca pe gutwero lweny ikome, ci wan kono watwero lweny ikome ningning?” <verse eid="2KI 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 10:5" />Pimeno dano ma onongo loyo kal ki ngat maloyo taun ducu, kacel ki ludongo ki lugwok lutino, gucwalo lok bot Yeku kun giwaco ni, “Wan lutici; wabitiyo gin ducu ma ibicikowa kwede. Wan pe wabiketo rwot mo; in itii gin ma inenoni ber.” <verse eid="2KI 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 10:6" />Yeko dok onwoyo coyo botgi waraga me aryo, kun waco ni, “Kace wun wutye tung bota, kace wuyube me woro doga, ci wukel wi lutino awobe pa rwotwu, ci wubin bota i Jejreel diki cawa onyo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:6">Awobe pa rwot Akab pyere abironi onongo jo madito me Camaria aye gwokogi dok gupitogi nicake iwang tinogi. <verse eid="2KI 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 10:7" />Ka waraga oo botgi, ci gumako lutino awobe pa rwot, gunekogi woko, jo pyere abironu ducu, ci gucoko wigi i aduku, ka gutero i Jejreel. <verse eid="2KI 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 10:8" />Ka kitito ki Yeku ni dong kityeko kelo wi lutino awobe pa rwot ducu, ci en ogamo ni, ki can wigi obed odu aryo ki inget dog cel me taun, kama kidonyo iye, wek obed nio wa odiko. <verse eid="2KI 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 10:9" />Ka okato odiko, ocung i dog cel ci owaco bot lwak ducu ni, “Wun pe wutye ki bal mo. An gira apiro lok me neko rwoda rwot Joram, ci atyeko neko en woko; ento anga ma oneko jo magi woko ducu? <verse eid="2KI 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 10:10" />Ber wunge atir ni lok pa Rwot pe poto piny nono. Lok mayam Rwot oloko ma dok ikom ot pa Akab bicobe ducu; pien Rwot otyeko tiyo gin mayam owaco ki i dog latice Eliya.” <verse eid="2KI 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 10:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 1:4">Koc 1:4</ref></char></note>Ci Yeku oneko jo ducu ma i ot pa Akab mudonge i Jejreel, oneko wa jone maditogu ducu, ki lureme macok kwede, ki ajwakine, nio ka otyekogi woko ducu ma acel mo pe odong.<verse eid="2KI 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kineko ludogola pa Akajia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 10:12" />Ka Yeku oa me cito i Camaria. Ki i yoo ma onongo en tye i Bet-eked kama lukwat gigure iye, <verse eid="2KI 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 10:13" />en oromo ki jo ma gin ludogola pa Akajia rwot me Juda, ci openyogi ni, “Wun angagi?” Ci gugamo ni, “Wan ludogola pa Akajia, wan wabino kamoto lutino kal ki lutino awobe pa daker yo.” <verse eid="2KI 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 10:14" />Ci en owaco ni, “Wumakgi makwo.” Ci gumakogi makwo, ka gunekogi woko kanget bur me Bet-eked. Welgi onongo tye dano pyere angwen wiye aryo, ci en pe oweko acel mo obwot.<verse eid="2KI 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kineko ludogola pa Akab mudong ducu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 10:15" />Ka Yeku oa woko ki kunu, ci orwate ki Yekonadab wod pa Rekab ma bino kajolo wiye; ci omoto en, kun wace ni, “Cwinyi leng ikoma macalo an cwinya leng kwede i komini?” Yekonadab odok iye ni, “Atye kitmeno.” Ci Yeku owace ni, “Ka itye kitmeno, ci cwal cingi bota.” Ci ocwalo cinge. Ci Yeku otinge i gadigadine, <verse eid="2KI 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 10:16" />kun wace ni, “Bin wacit kacel, wek inen kit ma arima omaka kwede pi Rwot.” Kitmeno Yeku otere wa i Camaria. <verse eid="2KI 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 10:17" />Ka oo i Camaria, ci oneko jo pa Akab ducu ma onongo gudong kunu, nio ka oyweyogi woko ducu liweng, kit mayam Rwot oloko ki Eliyani.<verse eid="2KI 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kineko jo ducu ma woro Baal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 10:18" />Yeku ocoko lwak ducu me Camaria, ci owaco botgi ni, “Akab yam oworo Baal manok mo, ento an dong abiwore makato. <verse eid="2KI 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 10:19" />Piman wulwonga lunebi pa Baal ducu, ki jo ma giworo en ducu, ki ajwakine ducu; pe ngat mo obed peke, pien atye ki gitum madwong me atyera bot Baal; dano mo ma bibedo peke, pe bibedo makwo.” Ento Yeku otiyo ki ryeko laum wang, pien onongo oyube me tyeko luwor Baal woko. <verse eid="2KI 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 10:20" />Yeku dok ociko ni, “Wulwong coke madit pi woro Baal!” Ci kilwongo kacoke. <verse eid="2KI 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 10:21" />Ci Yeku ocwalo kwena oromo i Icrael ducu, ci jo ducu ma woro Baal gubino; pe dano mo odong ma pe obino. Ci gucako donyo i ot pa Baal, ci ot pa Baal opong tungi ki tungi ducu. <verse eid="2KI 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 10:22" />Ci Yeku owaco bot ladit me ot bongi ni okel ginaruka pi luwor Baal ducu. <verse eid="2KI 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 10:23" />Ci Yeku oa ocito i ot pa Baal kacel ki Yekonadab wod pa Rekab; ci owaco bot luwor Baal ni, “Wuyeny, wek wunen ni lutic pa Rwot Lubanga mo pe odong ikinwu, kono luwor Baal keken.” <verse eid="2KI 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 10:24" />Ci en ki Yekonadab gudonyo katyero gityer ki gitum awangagu inyim Baal. Yeku onongo dong okano jo pyere aboro woko inge ot, kun ocikogi ni, “Ka ngat mo oweko dano acel ki ikom jo ma amiyo i cingwuni obwot, ci biculu wange ki kwone.” <verse eid="2KI 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 10:25" />Ka Yeku otyeko tyero gitum awanga, ci owaco bot lukurpiny ki ludito pa acikari ducu ni, “Wudony i ot, wunekgi woko; pe wuwek dano mo obwot.” Kitmeno gunekogi woko ki pala lucwan, ci lukurpiny ki ludito pa acikari guywayogi gubolo komgi woko. Ka gudonyo i kicika ma i tyelo ot pa Baal, <verse eid="2KI 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 10:26" />ci gukelo wir me cal pa Baal ma nene tye i ot pa Baal woko, ci guwangogi woko. <verse eid="2KI 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 10:27" />Dok gumuku wir me cal pa Baal, ka dok gumuku ot pa Baal bene, guloko odoko ot coron nio wa onyo.<verse eid="2KI 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 10:28" />Kitmeno Yeku ojwayo tim me woro Baal woko ki i Icrael. <verse eid="2KI 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 10:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:28-30">1 Luk 12:28-30</ref></char></note>Ento en omede ki lakit tim pa Jeroboam wod pa Nebat ma omiyo jo Icrael gubalo kun giworo cal lutino twoni me jabu i Betel ki i Dan. <verse eid="2KI 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 10:30" />Ci Rwot owaco bot Yeku ni, “Pien in ityeko timo gin ducu ma amito ikom ot pa Akab, abimiyo likwayi bibedo iwi komker me Icrael nio i yalwak me angwen.” <verse eid="2KI 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 10:31" />Ento Yeku yam pe ogwoke kalubu cik pa Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael ki cwinye ducu; pe obwoto lubu bal pa Jeroboam, ma en omiyo jo Icrael bene gubaloni.<verse eid="2KI 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">To pa Yeku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 10:32" />Ikare meno Rwot ocako jwiko lobo Icrael woko. Kajael olwenyo ikomgi, ci omayo lobo Icrael ducu. <verse eid="2KI 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 10:33" />Tung kunyango me kulu Jordan omayo iye lobo Gilead ducu, ki jo pa Gad, jo pa Reuben ki jo pa Manace, cake ki i Aroer ma inget nota kulu Amon, en aye lobo Gilead ki Bacan.<verse eid="2KI 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 10:34" />Lok kom Yeku mudonge ducu, ki gin ducu mayam otiyo, ki teke ducu, kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro pa Luker me Icrael. </char> <verse eid="2KI 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 10:35" />Kitmeno Yeku oto ci oywe kacel ki kwarine, ci kiyiko i Camaria. Wode Yekoakaj aye oleyo katyene. <verse eid="2KI 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 10:36" />Kare ma Yeku oloyo jo Icrael ki i Camaria oromo mwaka pyere aryo wiye aboro.<verse eid="2KI 10:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2KI 11" />
  <para style="s1">Atalia daker me Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 22:10-23:15">2 Tek 22:10—23:15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 11:1" />Ka Atalia onenoni wode Akajia ma onongo rwot me juda dong kineko woko, ci en omiyo twero ni kinek jo ducu me otker woko. <verse eid="2KI 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 11:2" />Ento Yekoceba, nya pa rwot Joram, ma lamin Akajia, otingo Yoaci wod pa Akajia ki ikin awobe pa rwot ma onongo kibinekogini, ci okano en ki lapidine i kicika mo me butu matye i Ot pa Lubanga, omiyo Atalia pe onongo kome ci latin obwot, pe kineko. <verse eid="2KI 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 11:3" />Ci Yekoceba obedo ki Yoaci mwaka abicel, kun kano i Ot pa Rwot, ikare ma Atalia tye kaloyo lobo.<verse eid="2KI 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 11:4" />Ento i mwaka me abirone Yekoyada olwongo ludito ma lulo buca mony pa jo miya ma pa jo Kari ki pa lukurpiny, ci oterogi i Ot pa Lubanga. Ki kunu, en oketo gicike kwedgi, ci omiyo gukwongo kwong, ka onyutu botgi Yoaci wod pa rwot Akajia. <verse eid="2KI 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 11:5" />En ocikogi ni, “Man aye gin ma wubitiyo: dul acel me adek ma ikomwu, jo ma gia i dog ticgi inino me Cabit, ma gikuru ot pa rwot, gibikuru gangkal, <verse eid="2KI 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 11:6" />kun dul acel me adek mukene gibikuru dogola me Cur, ki acel me adek gibikuru dogola ma inge lukurpiny. <verse eid="2KI 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 11:7" />Dulwu aryo ma gibibino i dog ticgi inino me Cabit pi kuru ot pa Lubanga, <verse eid="2KI 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 11:8" />gibirumu rwot dyere, kun dano acel acel tye ki jami lwenye i cinge. Ka dano mo obino katemo baro kin tyengwu, kibineko woko. Wubibedo ki rwot kama en bicito iye ducu.”<verse eid="2KI 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 11:9" />Ludito mony gutiyo gin ducu kit ma ajwaka Yekoyada ocikogi kwede; ladit mony acel acel okelo jone ma onongo gubia woko ki i dog ticgi inino me Cabit, ki jo ma nene gibino i dog tic inino me Cabit. Gin ducu gucito bot ajwaka Yekoyada. <verse eid="2KI 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 11:10" />Ajwaka ocako miyo bot ludito me mony lwak tong ki kwot ma onongo yam pa rwot Daudi, ma onongo tye i Ot pa Lubanga. <verse eid="2KI 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 11:11" />Lukurpiny gucung kun dano acel acel omako jami lwenye i cinge, cake wa i agiki ot tung kupiny nio kwede wa i agiki ot tung kumalo, kun girumu keno tyer ki ot bene. <verse eid="2KI 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 11:12" />Ka dong ajwaka Yekoyada okelo Yoaci wod pa rwot, ci oketo lalukana iwiye, ka kimiye buk adola ma kicoyo cik ma rwodi myero gutii kwede ka giloyo lobo, ka kitucu atir ni en dong rwot, ci kiwire ki moo; ci dano gudange kun gidongo cinggi ka giwaco ni, “Rwot obed kwo nakanaka!”<verse eid="2KI 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 11:13" />Ka Atalia owinyo wo pa lukurpiny ki pa lwak, ci ocito bot lwak wa i Ot pa Lubanga. <verse eid="2KI 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 11:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:3">2 Luk 23:3</ref></char></note>Ka ongiyo piny, ci oneno rwot ocung ka nget wir, kit ma rwodi cung kwede, kun ludito me mony ki lukut tum gurumu rwot, ki lwak ducu gubedo ka wo ki tum kun cwinygi yom. Ci Atalia oyeco bongone, kun kok ni, “Roro yai! Roro!” <verse eid="2KI 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 11:15" />Ci ajwaka Yekoyada ociko ludito ma giloyo wi mony ni, “Wukel dakonu woko ki ikin tyeng; wunek wa jo ma gimito laro kwone woko ducu.” Pien ajwaka onongo pe omitoni kineke ki i Ot pa Lubanga. <verse eid="2KI 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 11:16" />Ci gumako Atalia, ci gutere i otker, ci guneke i dogcel me aguragura.<verse eid="2KI 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yekoyada okelo alokaloka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 23:16-21">2 Tek 23:16-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 11:17" />Ci ajwaka Yekoyada oketo gicike ikin Rwot Lubanga ki rwot Yoaci ki lwak, wek gubed lwak pa Rwot Lubanga; ka dok oketo gicike ikin rwot ki lwak. <verse eid="2KI 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 11:18" />Ka lwak jo Icrael ducu ma onongo gitye kunu gugware gucito i ot pa Baal ci gumuku gureto woko piny. Guturu keno tyere ducu kun gingido cal ducu me awora woko matinotino, ci guneko Matan ma ajwaka pa Baal ki inyim keno tyer. Lacen ajwaka Yekoyada oketo acikari me gwoko Ot pa Lubanga. <verse eid="2KI 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 11:19" />Ci otero ludito ma lulo buca mony pa jo miya, ki jo Kari, ki lukurpiny ki lwak ma i lobo ducu, ci gukelo rwot woko nia ki i Ot pa Lubanga kun gidore giwok ki i dogola pa lukurpiny nio kwede wa i otker. Ci rwot obedo piny iwi komker. <verse eid="2KI 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 11:20" />Kitmeno lwak ducu ma i lobo cwinygi obedo yom; dok piny okwe mot ki inge to pa Atalia ma kineko ki pala lucwan i otker.<verse eid="2KI 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 11:21" />Yekoac<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="fk">Yekoac </char> bene kicoyo ni Yoaci. </note> ocamo ker odoko rwot me Juda ma mwaka me dite onongo tye abiro.<verse eid="2KI 11:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2KI 12" />
  <para style="s">Loc pa Yoaci me Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 24:1-16">2 Tek 24:1-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 12:1" />I mwaka me abiro me loc pa Yeku, en aye Yoaci ocako iye loc i Jerucalem pi mwaka pyere angwen. Nying mine Jibia me Beer-ceba. <verse eid="2KI 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 12:2" />Yoaci obedo katiyo gin manen atir iwang Rwot ikare me kwone ducu, pien ajwaka Yekoyada obedo kapwonyo en. <verse eid="2KI 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 12:3" />Kadi bed kumeno, wang jogi ma iwi godi pe omukugi woko; lwak pud gumede katumu gitum ki wango odok eceta iwang jogi ma iwi godi.<verse eid="2KI 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 12:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 3:11-16">Nia 3:11-16</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ka Yoaci olwongo ajwaki pa Lubanga ci ocikogi ni, “Wucok lim ducu me ryal ma dano gijogo macalo gityer maleng i Ot pa Lubanga, lim ducu me ajog ma dano gikelo kit ma kingolo i wigi, ki lim ducu ma dano gikelo kit ma cwinygi opwoyo. <verse eid="2KI 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 12:5" />Ajwaka acel acel omyero ogam lim ki bot jo ma en ngeyogi, wek guroc ki Ot pa Lubanga kama kinongo ni mite me aroca.” <verse eid="2KI 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 12:6" />Ento me o i mwaka me pyere aryo wiye adek me loc pa rwot Yoaci, onongo ajwaki peya guroco kamo ikom Ot pa Lubanga, <verse eid="2KI 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 12:7" />omiyo rwot Yoaci olwongo ajwaka Yekoyada ki ajwaki mukene ducu, ci openyogi ni, “Pingo pe wutye karoco Ot pa Lubanga? Cake Kombedi pe dong wugwok lim mo ma wucokoni, ento wucwal lim matyeni wek kicak roco Ot pa Lubanga woko.” <verse eid="2KI 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 12:8" />Kitmeno ajwaki guye ni pe dong gibigamo lim mo ki bot lwak, dok gin aye pe gibibedo kaloyo tic me roco Ot pa Lubanga bene.<verse eid="2KI 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 12:9" />Ci ajwaka Yekoyada okwanyo canduk mo, otucu laum wiye, ci oguru tung acuc me nget keno tyer ki i dogola ma kidonyo ki iye i Ot pa Lubanga. Ci ajwaki ma gikuru dogola guketo iye lim ducu ma dano gukelo. <verse eid="2KI 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 12:10" />Kace guneno ni lim madwong tye i canduk, ci karan pa rwot gin ki ajwaka madit gibino, ci gikwano lim ma kinongo ci kitweyo i kicaa. <verse eid="2KI 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 12:11" />Ka dong gutyeko ngeyo wel lim, ci kimiyo lime i cing jo ma giloyo dog tic me Ot pa Lubanga; ci jo maloyo dog tic giculu lupaa bao, lugedo, <verse eid="2KI 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 12:12" />lugedo ki godi, lupaa godi, kacel ki pi wilo bao ki godi ma kimuku pi roco Ot pa Lubanga, ki pi cul ducu ma mite. <verse eid="2KI 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 12:13" />Ento pe kitiyo ki lim ma kikelo i Ot pa Lubanga me yubu becen me ryal, magac, atabo, tum nyo jami me jabu nyo me ryal mo me tic kwede i Ot pa Lubanga. <verse eid="2KI 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 12:14" />Lim meno ducu onongo ki miyo bot lutic ma gitye kayubu Ot pa Lubanga. <verse eid="2KI 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 12:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 22:7">2 Luk 22:7</ref></char></note>Pe gubedo kapenyo lok kom lim ki bot jo ma kimiyo lim i cinggi pi culu lutic, pien gubedo katic kwede ki gen. <verse eid="2KI 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 12:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 7:7">Lev 7:7</ref></char></note>Lim ma oa ki ikom gitum me tingo alii, ki lim ma oa ki ikom gitum me bal, pe kitero i Ot pa Lubanga; meno bedo lim pa ajwaki.<verse eid="2KI 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 12:17" />Ikare meno Kajael rwot me Ciria ocito olwenyo ikom taun me Gat ci oloyo lweny woko; ka dok oloke kalweny ikom Jerucalem. <verse eid="2KI 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 12:18" />Ci Yoaci rwot me Juda okwanyo gityer mayam kidyero ducu, ma kwarine Yekocapat ki Jekoram ki Akajia ma luker pa Juda yam gudyero ki Rwot, ci omedo ikom mot ma en kikome odyero, kacel ki lwak jabu ducu ma kinongo i ot kano lim ma i Ot pa Lubanga ki ma i otker ducu, ci ocwalo bot Kajael rwot me Ciria. Ka Kajael oa ci pe olwenyo ikom i Jerucalem.<verse eid="2KI 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 12:19" />Lok kom Yoaci mudonge ducu, ki gin ducu ma en otiyo, kicoyo i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro pa Luker me Juda.</char> <verse eid="2KI 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 12:20" />Ludito monye aryo Jojakar wod pa Cimeat ki Yekojabad wod pa Comer gupiro lok, ci guneko Yoaci i ot pa Millo, matye i kora yoo ma dok i Cilla. <verse eid="2KI 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 12:21" />Kiyiko Yoaci kacel ki kwarine i gangkal pa Daudi, ci wode Amajia oleyo katyene.<verse eid="2KI 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2KI 13" />
  <para style="s1">Loc pa Yekoakaj rwot me Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 13:1" />I mwaka me pyere aryo wiye adek me loc pa Yoaci wod pa Akajia rwot me Juda, en aye Yekoakaj wod pa Yeku ocako iye loyo jo Icrael ki i Camaria, ci obedo kaloc pi mwaka apar wiye abiro. <verse eid="2KI 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 13:2" />En obedo katiyo gin manen marac iwang Rwot Lubanga, kun lubu bal pa Jeroboam wod pa Nebat ma en omiyo jo Icrael bene gubalo i yo acelu; en pe obwoto lubu tim marac. <verse eid="2KI 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 13:3" />Ci kiniga pa Rwot Lubanga otuge ikom Icrael, ma omiyo Kajael rwot me Ciria, ki Ben-adad wod pa Kajael obedo kalweny ikomgi kare ki kare. <verse eid="2KI 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 13:4" />Lacen Yekoakaj olego kun bako doge bot Rwot Lubanga, ci Rwot owinyo kokone; pien oneno aun pa jo Icrael, kit ma rwot me Ciria unugi kwede. <verse eid="2KI 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 13:5" />Ma omiyo Rwot Lubanga omiyo lalar bot jo Icrael, ci gubwot ki i cing jo Ciria, ci jo Icrael gubedo i pacogi kit ma con ca. <verse eid="2KI 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 13:6" />Ento pe gubwoto lubu kit bal pa jo me ot pa rwot Jeroboam ma gumiyo jo Icrael bene gubedo kalubuni, ento gumede kalubugi. Ki yen ma kipayo pi cal jok ma dako ma kilwongo Acera bene onongo pud tye i Camaria. <verse eid="2KI 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 13:7" />Rwot oweko Yekoakaj pe odong ki monye mo, kono wegi aguragura pyere abic keken, ki gadigadi lweny apar, ki acikari alip apar ma giwoto ki tyen gi; pien rwot me Ciria onekogi otyeko woko, omiyo gurade piny macalo putu apwa ma kinyono.<verse eid="2KI 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 13:8" />Lok kom Yekoakaj mudonge ducu, ki gin mayam otiyo kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro pa Luker me Icrael. </char> <verse eid="2KI 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 13:9" />Kitmeno Yekoakaj oto, oywe kacel ki kwarine, ci kiyiko i Camaria, Yekoac ma wode aye oleyo katyene.<verse eid="2KI 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Loc pa Yekoac rwot me Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 13:10" />I mwaka me pyere adek wiye abiro me loc pa Yoaci rwot me Juda, en aye Yekoac wod pa Yekoakaj ocako iye loyo jo Icrael ki i Camaria, ci obedo kaloc pi mwaka apar wiye abicel. <verse eid="2KI 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 13:11" />En bene obedo katiyo gin manen marac iwang Rwot. Pe obwoto lubu lwak bal pa Jeroboam wod pa Nebat, ma en omiyo jo Icrael bene gubaloni; ento obedo ka lubugi. <verse eid="2KI 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 13:12" />Lok kom Yekoac mudonge ducu, ki gin ducu ma otiyo, ki tek mere mayam olwenyo kwede ikom Amajia rwot me Juda, kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro pa Luker me Icrael. </char> <verse eid="2KI 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 13:13" />Yekoac oto, oywe kacel ki kwarine, ka Jeroboam ocako bedo iwi komker mere, ci Yekoac kiyiko i Camaria kacel ki luker me Icrael.<verse eid="2KI 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">To pa Elica</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 13:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 2:12">2 Luk 2:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ikare ma two omako Elica, ma en aye two ma bineke, Yekoac rwot me Icrael ocito bote ci okok inyime kun waco ni, “Wora, wora! Gin ango ma wegi gadigadi lweny me Icrael ki wegi aguragura bitwero labongo in do ya!” <verse eid="2KI 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 13:15" />Ci Elica owaco bot Yekoac ni, “Mak atum ki aterogu”; ci en omako atum ki aterogu. <verse eid="2KI 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 13:16" />Ci dok owaco bot rwot me Icrael ni, “Tel atum”; ci otelo, ci Elica oketo cinge iwi cing rwot, <verse eid="2KI 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 13:17" />kun wace ni, “Yab dirica ma tung kunyango”; ci oyabo. Elica dok owaco bote ni, “Ba atero”; ci obayo. Ci owaco ni, “In ibedo atero pa Rwot me loc! In ibedo atero me loyo jo Ciria! Pien ibilweny ki jo Ciria i Apek nio ka i tyekogi ducu.” <verse eid="2KI 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 13:18" />Dok owaco ni, “Mak atero”; ci omakogi. Ci dok owaco bot rwot me Icrael ni, “Googi ikom ngom”; ci ogoyo tyen adek, ci ogiko. <verse eid="2KI 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 13:19" />Ci Elica okeco ikome kun waco ni, “Kono nene igoyo ngom tyen abic nyo abicel, kono nene iloyo jo Ciria nio ka ityekogi matwal. Ento in dong ibilweny kwedgi ci ibiloyogi tyen adek keken.”<verse eid="2KI 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 13:20" />Kitmeno Elica oto, ci kiyike. I karenu buca mony pa luyak ma a ki i lobo Moab onongo gibino katimo tim aranyi ikom lobo Icrael i dog oro mwaka ki mwaka. <verse eid="2KI 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 13:21" />Ikare mo, ka onongo kicito kayiko laco mo, ci nen, buca mony pa luyak gutuc, ci luyik gubolo kom dano mutoni i lyel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bur lyel i lobo Icrael kipayo bedo calo boro ikom got, miyo ka kom lato ca mayam kiyikoni dong otop woko, ci kicoko cogone kiguro woko ikom pa wadine ma oto con. Ento cogo pa Elica onongo peya kicoko. </char></note> pa Elica. Ka kom danoni ogudu cogo pa Elica, ci ocer woko cut, ci otugi a malo ocung.<verse eid="2KI 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lweny ikin lobo Ciria ki Lobo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 13:22" />Rwot Kajael me Ciria obedo ka unu jo Icrael ikare ducu me loc pa Yekoakaj. <verse eid="2KI 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 13:23" />Ento Rwot onyutu ber mere botgi kun kica make ikomgi, ci oloke botgi pi gicikene mayam oketo ki Abraim, Icaka ki Yakobo. En pe omitoni ki tyekgi woko; dok bene pe oryemogi ki inyime nio wa onyo.<verse eid="2KI 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 13:24" />Ka Kajael rwot me Ciria oto, ci wode Ben-adad odoko rwot kun leyo katyene. <verse eid="2KI 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 13:25" />Ci Yekoac rwot me Icrael wod pa Yekoakaj omayo taun mogo ma Kajael yam oyako ki bot wone Yekoakaj ki i cing Ben-adad wod pa Kajael ikare me mony. Yekoac obedo kalweny ikome ci oloyo en tyen adek, ci odwoko taun ducu pa Icrael woko cen.<verse eid="2KI 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2KI 14" />
  <para style="s1">Loc pa Amajia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 25:1-24">2 Tek 25:1-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 14:1" />I mwaka me aryo me loc pa Yekoac wod pa Yekoakaj rwot me Icrael, en aye Amajia wod pa Yekoac rwot me Icrael ocako iye loc. <verse eid="2KI 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 14:2" />En ocamo ker ma mwaka me dite oromo pyere aryo wiye abic, ci obedo kaloc pi mwaka pyere aryo wiye abongwen ki i Jerucalem. Mine nyinge Yekoadin me Jerucalem. <verse eid="2KI 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 14:3" />En obedo katiyo gin manen atir iwang Rwot, ento pe obedo rom ki kwarone Daudi; en obedo katiyo gin ducu kit ma wone Yekoac yam obedo katiyone. <verse eid="2KI 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 14:4" />Ento wang jogi ma iwi godi pe omukugi woko; lwak pud gumede katumu gitum ki wango odok eceta iwang jogi ma iwi godi. <verse eid="2KI 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 14:5" />Ka kere dong omoko, ci oneko lutice mayam guneko woneni woko. <verse eid="2KI 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 14:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:16">Nwo 24:16</ref></char></note>Ento pe oneko lutino pa lunek, kit macalo yam kicoyo i buk me cik pa Moses, ma Rwot ociko ni, “Won latin pe kibineko pi bal pa wode, nyo latin pi bal pa wone; ento dano acel acel bito pi bale kikome.”<verse eid="2KI 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 14:7" />Amajia yam oneko jo Edom ma giromo alip apar ki i nota me kado, ka omayo taun madit me Cela ikare ma olwenyo ikome, ci ocako nyinge ni Jokteel, dok bene pud kilwongo kitmeno nio wa onyo.<verse eid="2KI 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 14:8" />Dok Amajia ocwalo lukwena bot Yekoac ma wod pa Yekoakaj, wod pa Yeku, rwot me Icrael, kun waco bote ni, “Bin wek wacam co wanene wang ki wang.” <verse eid="2KI 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 14:9" />Yekoakaj odwoko lok bot Amajia rwot me Juda ni, “Yam okutu mo ma iwi Lebanon ocwalo kwena bot yat cedar me Lebanon kun waco bote ni, ‘Miya nyari wek anyom ki woda.’ Ci lee tim mo me Lebanon ma owok ki kunu onyono okutunu piny. <verse eid="2KI 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 14:10" />In iloyo Edom ada Amajia, omiyo wii opil mada. Wek awaka meno oromi, dok i bed kwede mot i paconi. Pingo irobo dog dano me kelo ayela ikom in wek ipot kacel ki Juda?”<verse eid="2KI 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 14:11" />Ento Amajia pe owinyo. Omiyo Yekoakaj rwot me Icrael ocito, ci en ki Amajia gucamo co gurwate wang ki wang i lweny i Bet-cemec, ma gang me Juda. <verse eid="2KI 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 14:12" />Ci Icrael oloyo Juda, ci dano acel acel oringo woko i pacone.<verse eid="2KI 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 14:13" />Yekoac rwot me Icrael omako Amajia rwot me Juda wod pa Yoaci ma wod pa Akajia ki i Bet-cemec, ka ocito wa i Jerucalem ci omuku cel me Jerucalem maromo mita miya aryo kulu, nia ki i dog cel pa Epraim nio kwede wa i dog cel ma i twok gang. <verse eid="2KI 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 14:14" />Ci en oyako jabu ki ryal ducu ki atabo ducu ma onongo i Ot pa Lubanga, ki i ot kano lim ma iot pa rwot, kacel ki jo ma kimako me akoka, ci odok kwede wa i Camaria.<verse eid="2KI 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 14:15" />Lok kom Yekoac mudonge ducu ma en otiyo, ki teke ducu, ki kit mayam olwenyo kwede ki Amajia rwot me Juda, kityeko coyone i<char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro pa Luker me Icrael. </char> <verse eid="2KI 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 14:16" />Yekoac oto, oywe kacel ki kwarine, ci kiyike i Camaria kacel ki luker me Icrael. Wode Jeroboam aye oleyo katyene.<verse eid="2KI 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 14:17" />Ka Yekoac rwot me Icrael oto, ci Amajia rwot me Juda kong dok obedo kwo mwaka apar wiye abic. <verse eid="2KI 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 14:18" />Lok kom Amajia mudonge ducu kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro pa Luker me Juda. </char> <verse eid="2KI 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 14:19" />Jo mogo gucako piro lok ikom Amajia ki i Jerucalem, ci olwi oringo woko i Lakic. Ento gucwalo dano i kore wa i Lakic, ci kineke woko ki kunu. <verse eid="2KI 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 14:20" />Gukelo kome ki aguragura, ci kiyike i Jerucalem kacel ki kwarine i taun madit pa Daudi. <verse eid="2KI 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 14:21" />Ci lwak ducu ma i Juda gutingo Ajaria<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:21 </char><char style="fk">Ajaria </char> nyinge mukene Ujia. </note> ma mwaka me dite romo apar wiye abicel, ci guketo en odoko rwot me leyo katyen wone Amajia. <verse eid="2KI 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 14:22" />I nge to pa rwot Amajia, ma onongo dong kityeko yike woko kacel ki kwarine, en aye Ajaria ogero Elat ka odwoko cen ite loc me Juda.<verse eid="2KI 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Loc pa Jeroboam me aryo me Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 14:23" />I mwaka me apar wiye abic me loc pa Amajia wod pa Yoaci rwot me Juda, en aye Jeroboam wod pa Yekoac rwot me Icrael ocako iye loc ki i Camaria, ci obedo kaloc pi mwaka pyere angwen wiye acel. <verse eid="2KI 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 14:24" />En obedo katiyo gin manen marac iwang Rwot; pe obwoto lubu lwak bal pa Jeroboam wod pa Nebat, ma en omiyo jo Icrael bene gubaloni. <verse eid="2KI 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 14:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 1:1">Yon 1:1</ref></char></note>En odwoko wang lobo pa Icrael kit mayam tye con, cake ki i yoo ma donyo i Kamat nio kwede wa i nam ma i Araba, kit macalo Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael yam owaco, ma oloko ki i dog latice lanebi Yona wod pa Amittai, ma onongo a ki i Gat-keper.<verse eid="2KI 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 14:26" />Pien Rwot onongo oneno atwom pa jo Icrael odoko lit tutwal, pien ngat mo pe odong kunu, kadi opii nyo anywali, dok lakony Icrael mo bene onongo peke. <verse eid="2KI 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 14:27" />Ento Rwot onongo pe yam owaconi ebijwayo nying Icrael woko ki ite polo, omiyo olarogi ki i cing Jeroboam wod pa Yekoac.<verse eid="2KI 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 14:28" />Lok kom Jeroboam mudonge ducu, ki gin ma otiyo ducu, ki tek mere ducu, ki kit mayam olwenyo kwede, ki kit mayam odwoko kwede Damaciko ki Kamat i lobo Icrael, ma onongo yam kong gubedo i cing Juda, kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro pa Luker me Icrael. </char> <verse eid="2KI 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 14:29" />Ci Jeroboam oto, ci kiyike kacel ki kwarine; wode Jekaria aye oleyo katyene.<verse eid="2KI 14:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2KI 15" />
  <para style="s1">Loc pa Ajaria</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 26:1-23">2 Tek 26:1-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 15:1" />I mwaka me pyere aryo wiye abiro me loc pa Jeroboam rwot me Icrael en aye Ajaria wod pa Amajia, rwot me Juda, ocako iye loc. <verse eid="2KI 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 15:2" />En ocamo ker ma mwaka me dite romo apar wiye abicel, ci obedo kaloc ki i Jerucalem pi mwaka pyere abic wiye aryo. Mine nyinge Yekolia me Jerucalem. <verse eid="2KI 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 15:3" />En obedo katiyo gin manen atir iwang Rwot, kun lubu gin ducu mayam wone Amajia otiyo. <verse eid="2KI 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 15:4" />Kadi bed kumeno, wang jogi ma iwi godi pe omukugi woko; lwak pud gumede ki tumu gitum ki wango odok eceta iwang jogi ma iwi godi. <verse eid="2KI 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 15:5" />Rwot opwodo rwot Ajaria, ci odoko ladobo nio wa inino me tone, kun bedo i ot kakene. Yocam ma wod pa rwot aye obedo ladit maloyo ode, kun loyo kwede lwak ma i lobo meno.<verse eid="2KI 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 15:6" />Lok kom Ajaria mudonge ducu, ki gin ducu mayam otiyo, kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro pa Luker me Juda.</char> <verse eid="2KI 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 15:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:1">Ica 6:1</ref></char></note>Ajaria oto, ci kiyike kacel ki kwarine, i taun madit pa Daudi. Yocam ma wode aye oleyo katyene.<verse eid="2KI 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Loc pa Jekaria me Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 15:8" />I mwaka me pyere adek wiye aboro me loc pa Ajaria rwot me Juda en aye Jekaria wod pa Jeroboam ocako loyo iye jo Icrael ki i Camaria pi dwe abicel. <verse eid="2KI 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 15:9" />En obedo katiyo gin manen marac iwang Rwot, kit mayam kwarine gutiyo. Pe obwoto lubu kit bal pa Jeroboam wod pa Nebat, ma en omiyo jo Icrael bene gubaloni. <verse eid="2KI 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 15:10" />Calum wod pa Jabec opiro lok ikome, ci obino ocobe ki pala lucwan ikin dano ki i Ibleam ci oneke woko, ka dong odoko rwot ma kakare.<verse eid="2KI 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 15:11" />Lok kom Jekaria mudonge ducu dong kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro pa Luker me Icrael.</char> <verse eid="2KI 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 15:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 10:30">2 Luk 10:30</ref></char></note>Man aye lok ma Rwot yam ocike ki Yeku ni, “Likwayi gibibedo iwi komker me Icrael nio wa i yalwak me angwene”, ci otime kitmeno.<verse eid="2KI 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Loc pa Calum rwot me Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 15:13" />Calum wod pa Jabec ocako loc i mwaka me pyere adek wiye abongwen me loc pa Ujia rwot me Juda, ci obedo kaloc pi dwe acel ki i Camaria. <verse eid="2KI 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 15:14" />Lacen Menakem wod pa Gad oa ki i Tirja, obino i Camaria, ci ocobo Calum wod pa Jabec oneko woko, ci odoko rwot ma kakare.<verse eid="2KI 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 15:15" />Lok kom Calum mudonge ducu, ki lok ma en opiro dong kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro pa Luker me Icrael.</char> <verse eid="2KI 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 15:16" />Ikare ma Menakem oa ki i Tirja, en ojwero taun me Tapua woko, ki jo ma gibedo iye ducu, ki taun ducu ma, nia wa i Tirja; pien pe guye ni en odony i igi, ma omiyo ojwerogi woko, kun ryako i mon muyac ducu ma kunu.<verse eid="2KI 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Loc pa Menakem me Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 15:17" />I mwaka me pyere adek wiye abongwen me loc pa Ajaria rwot me Juda, en aye Menakem wod pa Gad ocako iye loyo jo Icrael, ci obedo kaloc pi mwaka apar i Camaria. <verse eid="2KI 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 15:18" />En obedo katiyo gin manen marac iwang Rwot; ikare me kwone ducu pe obwoto lubu kit bal pa Jeroboam wod pa Nebat, ma en oweko jo Icrael bene gubaloni. <verse eid="2KI 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 15:19" />Ci Pul rwot me Aciria obino kamonyo lobo; ci Menakem omiyo bot Pul ryal maromo talanta alip acel, wek okonye pi miye tek me moko kere maber i lobone. <verse eid="2KI 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 15:20" />Lim meno Menakem ojogo ki bot jo Icrael ma lulonyo ducu, kun ngat acel acel oculu cekel me ryal pyere abic me amiya bot rwot me Aciria, omiyo rwot me Aciria odok cen i lobone.<verse eid="2KI 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 15:21" />Lok kom Menakem mudonge ducu, ki gin ducu mayam otiyo, kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro pa Luker me Icrael. </char> <verse eid="2KI 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 15:22" />Menakem oto, ci kiyike kacel ki kwarine, ci wode Pekakia aye oleyo katyene.<verse eid="2KI 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Loc pa Pekakia rwot me Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 15:23" />I mwaka me pyere abic me loc pa Ajaria rwot me Juda en aye Pekakia wod pa Menakem ocako iye loyo jo Icrael, ci obedo kaloc ki i Camaria pi mwaka aryo. <verse eid="2KI 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 15:24" />En obedo katiyo gin manen marac iwang Rwot, pe obwoto lubu kit bal pa Jeroboam wod pa Nebat, ma en oweko jo Icrael bene gubaloni. <verse eid="2KI 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 15:25" />Ci Peka wod pa Remalia ma ladit pa acikarine opiro lok ikome, kacel ki jo pyere abic me Gilead, ci oneke woko i Camaria, ki i gogo me ot pa rwot, ci en odoko rwot ma kakare.<verse eid="2KI 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 15:26" />Lok kom Pekakia mudonge ducu, ki gin mayam otiyo ducu, kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro pa Luker me Icrael.</char><verse eid="2KI 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Loc pa Peka rwot me Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 15:27" />I mwaka me pyere abic wiye aryo me loc pa Ajaria rwot me Juda, en aye Peka wod pa Remalia ocako iye loyo jo Icrael, ci obedo kaloc ki i Camaria pi mwaka pyere aryo. <verse eid="2KI 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 15:28" />En obedo katiyo gin manen marac iwang Rwot; pe obwoto lubu kit bal pa Jeroboam wod pa Nebat, ma en omiyo jo Icrael bene gubaloni.<verse eid="2KI 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 15:29" />Ikare pa Peka rwot me Icrael, en aye Tiglat-Pilecer rwot me Aciria obino ci omako taun madito magi: Ijon, Abel-Bet-Maaka, Janoa, Kedec ki Kajor kacel ki Gilead, Galilaya ki lobo Naputali ducu; ci oyako dano oterogi i opii wa i Aciria.<verse eid="2KI 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 15:30" />Kocea wod pa Ela opiro lok ikom Peka wod pa Remalia, ci oneko woko, ka dong odoko rwot ma kakare, i mwaka me pyere aryo me loc pa Yocam wod pa Ujia.<verse eid="2KI 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 15:31" />Lok kom Peka mudonge ducu, ki gin ducu mayam otiyo, kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro pa Luker me Icrael. </char><verse eid="2KI 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Loc pa Yocam rwot me Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 27:1-9">2 Tek 27:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 15:32" />I mwaka me aryo me loc pa Peka wod pa Remalia, en aye Yocam wod pa Ujia rwot me Juda ocako iye loc. <verse eid="2KI 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 15:33" />En ocamo ker ma mwaka me dite onongo romo pyere aryo wiye abic, ci obedo kaloc i Jerucalem pi mwaka apar wiye abicel. Nying mine Yeruca ma nya pa Jadok. <verse eid="2KI 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 15:34" />En obedo katiyo gin manen atir iwang Rwot, kun lubu gin ducu mayam wone Ujia otiyo. <verse eid="2KI 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 15:35" />Kadi bed kumeno, wang jogi ma iwi godi pe omukugi woko; lwak pud gumede katumu gitum ki wango odok eceta iwang jogi ma iwi godi. En ogero dogola mamalo me Ot pa Lubanga.<verse eid="2KI 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 15:36" />Lok kom Yocam ducu, ki gin ducu mayam otiyo, kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro pa Luker me Juda.</char> <verse eid="2KI 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 15:37" />Ikare meno Rwot Lubanga ocwalo Rejin rwot me Ciria kacel ki Peka wod pa Remalia kamonyo Juda. <verse eid="2KI 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 15:38" />Yocam oto, ci kiyike kacel ki kwarine i taun madit pa kwarone Daudi. Wode Akaj aye oleyo katyene.<verse eid="2KI 15:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2KI 16" />
  <para style="s1">Loc pa Akaj rwot me Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 28:1-27">2 Tek 28:1-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 16:1" />I mwaka me apar wiye abiro me loc pa Peka wod pa Remalia, en aye Akaj wod pa Yocam rwot me Juda ocako iye loc. <verse eid="2KI 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 16:2" />Akaj ocamo ker ma mwaka me dite pyere aryo, ci obedo kaloc i Jerucalem pi mwaka apar wiye abicel. En pe obedo katiyo gin manen atir iwang Rwot Lubangane, kit ma kwarone Daudi yam otiyoni. <verse eid="2KI 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 16:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:31">Nwo 12:31</ref></char></note>Ento obedo kalubu kit pa luker me Icrael. En bene omedo ki wango wode me gityer, kun lubu kwede tim me kwer pa rok mukene ma Rwot yam oryemogi woko ki inyim jo Icrael. <verse eid="2KI 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 16:4" />En obedo katumu gitum ki wango odok eceta iwang jogi ma iwi godi mabocone ducu ki iwi cere ki iwang ayweya ma ite yadi ma potgi oluk.<verse eid="2KI 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 16:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 7:1">Ica 7:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Rejin rwot me Ciria, ki Peka wod pa Remalia, rwot me Icrael, gutingo mony guterogi kalweny ikom Jerucalem, ci gurumu Akaj dyere, ento pe guloye. <verse eid="2KI 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 16:6" />Ikare meno rwot me Edom odwoko Elat ite loc me Edom, ka oryemo Lujuda woko ki i Elat; ci jo Edom gucako bino i Elat, gubedo iye nio wa onyo. <verse eid="2KI 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 16:7" />Akaj ocwalo lukwena bot Tiglat-Pilecer ma rwot me Aciria kun waco ni, “An latici, dok an a wodi, bin wek i lara ki i cing rwot me Ciria ki rwot me Icrael ma gitye kalweny ikoma.” <verse eid="2KI 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 16:8" />Akaj dok okwanyo ryal ki jabu ma onongo tye i Ot pa Lubanga, ki i ot kano lim ma i ot pa rwot, ci ocwalo me mot bot rwot me Aciria. <verse eid="2KI 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 16:9" />Rwot me Aciria owinyo kokone, ci otingo mony ocito kwede i Damaciko, ocako yako jo ma kunu oterogi i opii wa i Kir, ci oneko Rejin woko.<verse eid="2KI 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 16:10" />Ka rwot Akaj ocito i Damaciko kajolo wi Tiglat-Pilecer rwot me Aciria, ci oneno keno tyer matye i Damaciko, ci ocwalo cal me keno tyer meno bot ajwaka Uria, ki kit tiyone, kun nyutu kite ducu ki kore. <verse eid="2KI 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 16:11" />Ajwaka Uria ocako cano keno tyer kun cweyo kit ma rwot Akaj onongo ocwalo bote ki i Damaciko. En otimo kumeno ma onongo rwot Akaj peya odwogo ki i Damaciko. <verse eid="2KI 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 16:12" />Ka rwot odwogo ki i Damaciko, ci ocito ongiyo keno tyer, ci oito iye malo, <verse eid="2KI 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 16:13" />ci owango gitume me awanga, ki gityer mere me moko kwon, ka oonyo gityer amata, ocoro remo me gityer mere me lakwecwiny ikom keno tyer. <verse eid="2KI 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 16:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 27:1-2">Nia 27:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 4:1">2 Tek 4:1</ref></char></note>Ci okwanyo keno tyer me nyonyo bronze mayam tye inyim Rwot, ma onongo bedo inyim ot, i kabedo ma ikin keno tyere ki Ot pa Lubanga, ci oketo tung kumalo me keno tyer mere. <verse eid="2KI 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 16:15" />Rwot Akaj ociko ajwaka Uria kun waco ni, “Wang gitum awanga me odiko iwi keno tyer maditi, ki gityer me moko kwon me otyeno, ki gitum awanga ma rwot omiyo, ki gityere me moko kwon, kacel ki gitum awanga pa lwak ducu ma i lobo, ki gityergi me moko kwon, ki gityergi me amata. Ibicoro remo me gitum awanga ducu ikome bene, ki remo me gitum mukene ducu. Ento keno tyer me nyonyo bronze bibedo mera, me penyo iye dog Rwot.” <verse eid="2KI 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 16:16" />Ajwaka Uria otiyo gin ducu kitmeno, kit ma rwot Akaj ocikoni.<verse eid="2KI 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 16:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 7:23-39">1 Luk 7:23-39</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 4:2-6">2 Tek 4:2-6</ref></char>
    </note>Rwot Akaj ongolo mola ma apada ki ikom lutino gadigadi, ci okwanyo otako ki ikomgi, ka okwanyo nam woko ki ikom twoni mola ma onongo gitye i tereni, ci oketo ikom godi ma kipetogi piny. <verse eid="2KI 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 16:18" />Ki yoo ma kiumu wiye ma kiwok ki iye i ceng cabit, ki dogola pa rwot matye woko, en okwanyogi woko ki ikom Ot pa Lubanga, pi yomo cwiny rwot me Aciria.<verse eid="2KI 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 16:19" />Lok kom Akaj mudonge ducu, ki gin mayam en otiyo, kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro pa Luker me Juda.</char> <verse eid="2KI 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 16:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:28">Ica 14:28</ref></char></note>Akaj oto, ci kiyike kacel ki kwarine, i taun madit pa Daudi; wode Kejekia aye oleyo katyene.<verse eid="2KI 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2KI 17" />
  <para style="s1">Kocea rwot me Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 17:1" />I mwaka me apar wiye aryo me loc pa Akaj rwot me Juda, en aye Kocea wod pa Ela ocako loyo iye jo Icrael ki i Camaria ci obedo kaloc pi mwaka abongwen. <verse eid="2KI 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 17:2" />En obedo katiyo gin manen marac iwang Rwot, ento pe obedo marom ki luker me Icrael ma gukwongo nyime. <verse eid="2KI 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 17:3" />Calmanecer lawi rwodi me Aciria obino omonye; Kocea oilo cinge bote, ci ocako onyo mucoro bot Calmanecer mwaka ki mwaka. <verse eid="2KI 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 17:4" />Ento lacen i mwaka mo acel, rwot me Aciria oniang ni Kocea odobe woko; pien ocwalo lukwena bot Co, rwot me Ejipt, ci okwero onyo mucoro kit mayam onongo onyo kwede mwaka ki mwaka, omiyo rwot me Aciria omake, ci otweye woko i buc.<verse eid="2KI 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Camaria opoto i cing Calmanecer</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 17:5" />Ci Calmanecer omonyo lobo Icrael ducu, ka obino kwede wa i Camaria, ci orumu lobo meno dyere pi mwaka adek. <verse eid="2KI 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 17:6" />I mwaka me loc pa Kocea me abongwene en aye rwot me Aciria omayo kwede taun me Camaria, ci otero jo Icrael i opii wa i Aciria ci oketogi i taun madit me Kalak ki inget Kabor, ma en aye kulu ma i Gojan, ki i taun pa jo Medi.<verse eid="2KI 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 17:7" />Lok man otime kitmeno pien jo Icrael onongo gubalo inyim Rwot Lubangagi, mayam okwanyogi woko ki i lobo Ejipt, ki i cing Parao rwot me Ejipt. Dok gubedo ka woro lubanga mogo mukene, <verse eid="2KI 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 17:8" />kun gilubu kit pa lurok mayam Rwot oryemo woko ki inyim jo Icrael, ci gucako lubu yo ma pat ma luker me Icrael gukelo. <verse eid="2KI 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 17:9" />Jo Icrael gubedo katimo gin ma pe kakare inyim Rwot Lubangagi i mung. Gugero lwak odi iwang jogi meggi ken gi iwi godi inget taun gi ducu, cake ki ikom lubele pa lukurpiny nio kwede wa ikom taun ma kirumu ki cel gogo. <verse eid="2KI 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 17:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:23">1 Luk 14:23</ref></char></note>Gucibo wir jogi dok gucomo wir cal jok ma dako ma kilwongo Acera iwi godi ma bocone ducu ki iwi cere ki iwang ayweya ma ite yadi ma potgi oluk. <verse eid="2KI 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 17:11" />Gubedo ka wango odok eceta iwang jogi iwi godi ducu, macalo lurok mayam Rwot oryemo woko ki inyimgi. Gubedo katiyo gin maracu bene, ma omiyo kiniga omako Rwot. <verse eid="2KI 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 17:12" />Gubedo ka woro cal lubangagu mayam Rwot ojukugi pire kun waco ni, “Pe wubitiyo man.” <verse eid="2KI 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 17:13" />Rwot obedo kapoyo wi jo Icrael ki jo Juda, kun lanebi acel acel ki lanen acel acel cikogi ni, “Wuloke, wuwek kitwu maracuni, wumak lok ma aciko ducu, ki cik mera ducu, kun wulubu cik ducu mayam aciko ki kwariwu, ki ma abedo kacwalo botwu ki i dog lutica ma gin lunebi.” <verse eid="2KI 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 17:14" />Ento yam pe guworo doge; gubedo jo ma ngutgi nwang, macalo kwarigi con tye kwede, mayam pe guye Rwot Lubangagi. <verse eid="2KI 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 17:15" />Gucayo cike ducu, ki gicike mayam oketo ki kwarigi, ki lok ma obedo kapoyo ki wigi. Gubedo ka woro cal jogi ma konygi peke, ma omiyo gin bene gudoko jo ma konygi peke. Gubedo kalubu kit pa lurok mayam orumugi dyereni, jo mayam Rwot ojukugi ikomgi, ni pe gutim kit ma gin gitiyoni. <verse eid="2KI 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 17:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:28">1 Luk 12:28</ref></char></note>Gubwoto cik ma Rwot Lubanga ociko woko ducu, gutimo pirgi ken gi cal lutino twoni aryo me jabu ma kiliyo aliya; ka dok gucomo wir cal me woro jok ma dako ma kilwongo Acera; gucako woro ceng ki dwe wa ki lakalatwe ducu ma i polo, kun gitiyo bot Baal bene. <verse eid="2KI 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 17:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:10">Nwo 18:10</ref></char></note> Guwango awobegi ki anyiragi me gityergi, kun gityeto bene bot lutyet ki lungi i dyel; gumine keken gi pi tiyo gin manen marac iwang Rwot, kun gimiyo kiniga make. <verse eid="2KI 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 17:18" />Piman, kiniga omako Rwot matek ikom jo Icrael, ci oryemogi woko ki inyime; ngat mo pe odong kono ker pa Juda keken aye odong.<verse eid="2KI 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 17:19" />Ento jo pa Juda bene yam pe gumako lok ma Rwot Lubangagi ociko; gin gumako dok gulubu kit tim pa lurok ma jo Icrael gulubu. <verse eid="2KI 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 17:20" />Rwot okwero rok me Icrael woko ducu, ci oketogi i atwom mapek, omiyogi i cing luyakgi, nio ka oryemogi woko ki inyime.<verse eid="2KI 17:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 17:21" />Ka yam Rwot opoko Icrael woko ki ikom likwayo pa Daudi, gin guketo Jeroboam wod pa Nebat odoko rwotgi. Ci Jeroboam odwoyo wi jo Icrael woko ki kalubu gin ma Rwot ociko, ci omiyo gupoto i bal madito. <verse eid="2KI 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 17:22" />Jo Icrael gulubu bal ducu mayam Jeroboam otiyo; pe gubwoto tiyogi, <verse eid="2KI 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 17:23" />nio ka Rwot oryemogi woko, macalo yam oloko ki i dog lutice ducu ma lunebi. Kitmeno kicoko jo Icrael woko ki i lobogi, ci kiterogi wa i Aciria me bedo opii nio wa onyo.<verse eid="2KI 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aciria okelo rok mukene me bedo i Camaria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 17:24" />Rwot me Aciria yam okelo dano ki i Babilon, i Kuta, i Aya, i Kamat ki i Ceparvaim, ci oketogi gubedo i taun me Camaria, guleyo ka jo Icrael. Gucamo lobo me Camaria odoko meggi, ci gubedo i taun gi madito ducu. <verse eid="2KI 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 17:25" />Ikare ma gucako bedo i lobonu, gin pe guworo Rwot; omiyo Rwot ocwalo lwak labwor ma oneko jo mogo ikin gi. <verse eid="2KI 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 17:26" />Ci kitito loke bot rwot me Aciria ni, “Rok ducu ma iterogi kabedo i taun me Camariani gin pe gingeyo cik pa lubanga me lobonu, omiyo ocwalo lwak labwor ikin gi, ci nen, gitye kanekogi woko, pien gin pe gingeyo cik pa lubanga me lobonu.” <verse eid="2KI 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 17:27" />Ci rwot me Aciria ociko kun waco ni, “Wucwal ajwaka mo acel ki ikin jo mayam wukelogi ki kunu, wek en ocit opwony jo manyen ma gibedo kunu ki cik pa lubanga me lobonu.” <verse eid="2KI 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 17:28" />Ci ajwaka mo acel ki ikin ajwaki mayam ki terogi kunu ma oa ki i Camaria odwogo cen, obedo i Betel, ci opwonyogi ki kit ma omyero guwor Rwot Lubanga.<verse eid="2KI 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 17:29" />Ento rok acel acel ducu gumede mere ameda katiyo cal lubangagi ken gi, kun giketogi iwang jogi ma iwi godi mayam Lucamaria gutiyo. Rok acel acel gutiyo cal lubangagi i taun ma gibedo iye. <verse eid="2KI 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 17:30" />Jo Babilon gutiyo cal jok Cukot-benot, jo Kut gutiyo cal jok Nergal, jo Kamat gutiyo cal jok Acima; <verse eid="2KI 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 17:31" />jo Aya gutiyo cal jok Nibaj ki jok Tartak. Jo Ceparvaim gubedo kawango lutinogi ki mac bot Adramelek ki Anamelek ma gin jogi pa jo Ceparvaim. <verse eid="2KI 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 17:32" />Jo magi ducu bene guworo Rwot Lubanga, ento gukwanyo kwayi dano ducu ki ikin gi ken gi me bedo ajwaki me wang jogigi ma iwi godi me tyero gityer pirgi. <verse eid="2KI 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 17:33" />Kitmeno gin yam guworo Rwot Lubanga, ento gin bene gutiyo bot lubanga ma meggi, malube ki kit ma giworo kwede ki lubangagi i rok mapatpat mayam ki kwanyogi ki iye. <verse eid="2KI 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 17:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:28">Aca 32:28</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 35:10">35:10</ref></char></note>Kadi wa ikare man jo magi pud gilubu kit yogi maca. Gin pe giworo Rwot, dok pe gilubu cike ducu, nyo lok ma en ongolo, nyo cik ma en oketo, kadi wa cik mo mayam Rwot ociko ki likwayo pa Yakobo ma ocako nyinge ni Icrael. <verse eid="2KI 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 17:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:5">Nia 20:5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:9">Nwo 5:9</ref></char></note>Rwot yam oketo gicike kwedgi, kun cikogi ni, “Pe wubiworo lubanga mukene ducu; pe wuryebe inyimgi, pe wutii botgi, pe wutum gitum botgi. <verse eid="2KI 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 17:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Nwo 6:13</ref></char></note>Ento wubiworo Rwot mayam okwanyowu woko ki i lobo Ejipt ki tek madwong ki lanyut ma en otiyo; wubiworo en keken dok wubiryebe inyime, en aye wubitumu gitum bote. <verse eid="2KI 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 17:37" />Wubigwoke kun wulubu cik ducu, ki lok ma Rwot ongolo, cik ma en oketo, ki ginacika ma con ocoyo pirwu kare ducu. Pe wubiworo lubanga mukene ducu. <verse eid="2KI 17:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 17:38" />Pe wiwu biwil ikom gicike ma dong atyeko ketone kwedwu. Pe wubiworo lubanga mukene ducu. <verse eid="2KI 17:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2KI 17:39" />Wubiworo Rwot Lubangawu, en bene aye bilarowu ki i cing lumerokwu ducu.” <verse eid="2KI 17:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="2KI 17:40" />Ento yam gukwero woro doge woko, ento gubedo kalubu kitgi macon ca aye.<verse eid="2KI 17:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2KI 17:41" />Kitmeno rok meno ducu gubedo ka woro Rwot kun giworo bene cal lubangagi ma gupayo; lutinogi ki likwayogi bene gubedo katiyo kit mayam kwarigi gutiyoni, pud gitiyo kitmeno nio wa onyo.<verse eid="2KI 17:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2KI 18" />
  <para style="s1">Loc pa Kejekia rwot me Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 29:1-2">2 Tek 29:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 31:1">31:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 18:1" />I mwaka me adek me loc pa Kocea wod pa Ela rwot me Icrael, en aye Kejekia wod pa Akaj rwot me Juda ocako iye loc. <verse eid="2KI 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 18:2" />En ocamo ker ma mwaka me dite pyere aryo wiye abic, ci obedo kaloc pi mwaka pyere aryo wiye abongwen ki i Jerucalem. Nying mine Abi, ma nya pa Jekaria. <verse eid="2KI 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 18:3" />Kejekia obedo katiyo gin manen atir iwang Rwot kun lubu gin ducu mayam kwarone Daudi otiyo. <verse eid="2KI 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 18:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:9">Wel 21:9</ref></char></note> En omuku lwak wang jogi ma iwi godi, oturu wir jogigu ducu, ka otongo cal jogi ma kicomo pi woro jok ma dako ma kilwongo Acera woko, ka dok ongido twol mola mayam Moses otiyoni, pien nio wa ikare meno onongo jo Icrael pud giwango odok eceta pi worone. Onongo kilwongo twol molanu ni Nekucitan. <verse eid="2KI 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 18:5" />Kejekia obedo kageno Rwot, Lubanga me Icrael, ma omiyo pe ngat mo onen marom ki en ki ikin luker me Juda ducu ma gulubu ngeye, kadi wa ikin luker ma gukwongo nyime bene. <verse eid="2KI 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 18:6" />En obedo lagen inyim Rwot matek; pe obwoto lubu lok pa Rwot, ento obedo kalubu cik ducu mayam Rwot ociko ki Moses. <verse eid="2KI 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 18:7" />Omiyo Rwot yam tye kwede, ci Kejekia onongo gum i gin ducu ma en otiyo. En ojemo ikom rwot me Aciria, ci okwero bedo ite loce woko. <verse eid="2KI 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 18:8" />Kejekia olwenyo ki jo Piliciti ci oloyogi woko. En omayo lobogi nio wa i Gaja ki lobo ma ingete; oloyogi i kabedogi ducu, cake ki ikom lubele pa lukurpiny nio kwede wa i taun gi madito ma kirumugi ki cel gogo.<verse eid="2KI 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 18:9" />I mwaka me angwen me loc pa Kejekia, ma en aye mwaka me abirone me loc pa Kocea wod pa Ela rwot me Icrael, Calmanecer rwot me Aciria obino kalweny ikom Camaria ci orumu woko ki monye. <verse eid="2KI 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 18:10" />I nge mwaka me adeke, en aye kiloyo kwede ki Camaria; man otime i mwaka me abicel me loc pa Kejekia, ma en aye mwaka me abongwen me loc pa Kocea rwot me Icrael. <verse eid="2KI 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 18:11" />Rwot me Aciria ocoko jo Icrael ci oterogi i opii wa i Aciria ci oketogi i taun madit me Kalak, ki inget Kabor, ma en aye kulu ma i Gojan, ki i taun madito pa jo Medi. <verse eid="2KI 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 18:12" />Camaria opoto i cing Aciria pien jo Icrael onongo gukwero woro dog Rwot Lubangagi woko, ento gukalo wi gicikene, kacel ki lok ducu mayam Moses ma latic pa Rwot ocikogi kwede; pe guwinyo loke kadi ki woro doge bene.<verse eid="2KI 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cenakerib omonyo lobo Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 32:1-19">2 Tek 32:1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 36:1-22">Ica 36:1-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 18:13" />I mwaka me apar wiye angwen me loc pa rwot Kejekia, en aye Cenakerib rwot me Aciria obino kwede kalweny ikom taun madito ducu me Juda ma kirumugi ki cel gogo, ci omayogi ducu. <verse eid="2KI 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 18:14" />Kejekia rwot me Juda ocwalo kwena bot rwot me Aciria wa i Lakic kun waco ni, “An atimo bal; dok cen, wek lweny ikoma obedi, gin ducu ma i bingolo iwiya abiculune.” Ci rwot me Aciria ongolo iwi Kejekia rwot me Juda wel me ryal maromo talanta miya adek, ki jabu maromo talanta pyere adek. <verse eid="2KI 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 18:15" />Kejekia ocwalo ryal ducu ma onongo tye i Ot pa Lubanga, ki i ot kano lim ma i ot pa rwot. <verse eid="2KI 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 18:16" />Ikare meno Kejekia omuku jabu woko ducu mayam kimwono ikom kika me Ot pa Lubanga, ki jabu mayam en Kejekia rwot me Juda omwono kwede okar me dogola, ci otingogi ocwalo bot rwot me Aciria. <verse eid="2KI 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 18:17" />Ento rwot me Aciria ocwalo ludito wi monye adek mucwiny ki mony madit ma gua ki Lakic gucito ka monyo Kejekia i Jerucalem. Ka guo kunu, ci gucito gucung inget yoo pii mamol a ki i joro mamalo, i yoo gudo ma cito i poto kama kiketo iye rangi i bongo. <verse eid="2KI 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 18:18" />Ka guoro dano kalwongo rwot Kejekia, ci Eliakim wod pa Kilkia ma en aye onongo ladit maloyo jami ma i ot pa rwot aye obino botgi, kacel ki Cebna ma karan, ki Joa wod pa Acap, lacoo lok matime. <verse eid="2KI 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 18:19" />Ci ngat acel ki ikin ludito wi mony me Aciria owaco botgi ni wuwac bot Kejekia ni, “Rwot madit me Aciria openyo kuman ni, ‘In i jengo geni ikom gin ango? <verse eid="2KI 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 18:20" />In i tamo ni lok dog bedo rom ki ryeko me lweny ki mony madit me loyo lweny? In mono ijenge ikom anga, ma omiyo i jemo woko ikom Aciriani? <verse eid="2KI 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 18:21" />Nen, kombedi i loko Ejipt odoko odo ma ijenge ikome, kun en lagada ma otur woko, ma bitucu cing dano mo ma ojenge ikome. Meno aye kit ma Parao rwot me Ejipt tye kwede ka ngat mo jenge ikome.’ <verse eid="2KI 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 18:22" />Nyo wubiwaco ni, ‘Wan giwa wajenge ikom Rwot ma Lubangawa!’ Pe en aye ma Kejekia dong omuku wang jogine ma iwi godi, ki keno tyere wokoni, kun waco bot jo Jerucalem ki Juda ni, ‘Wubiworo Lubanga inyim keno tyer man ma i Jerucalem’? <verse eid="2KI 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 18:23" />Wek kong waket lacama! Ladita rwot me Aciria bimiyi aguragura alip aryo, kace in ki tung boti i bitwero nongo wel co marom meno me ngwec i wigi. <verse eid="2KI 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 18:24" />In i bitwero ryemo ladit mony mo me Aciria ma rwome lapiny loyo ningning, kace ijenge ikom Ejipt pi nongo gadigadi lweny ki wegi aguragura? <verse eid="2KI 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 18:25" />Dok bene i tamoni an abino kalweny ikom kabedo man wek atyek woko, labongo twero pa Rwot Lubanga? Wai Rwot Lubanga aye ma owaco bota ni, ‘Cit i lweny ikom lobo man i tyek woko yo!’”<verse eid="2KI 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 18:26" />Cutcut Eliakim wod pa Kilkia, ki Cebna ki Joa guwaco bot Rabcake ni, “Walegi i lok ki wan lutici i leb Aram, pien wawinyo. Pe i lok kwedwa i leb Ibru ma lwak ma gitye iwi cel bene giwinyo.” <verse eid="2KI 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 18:27" />Ento Rabcake ogamo doggi ni, “I tamo ni rwoda ocwala kaloko lok magi bot laditwu ki botwu keken bo, pe wa bot lwak ma gubedo iwi cel bene, ma gin kacel ki wun gukemo can me camo cetgi ken gi kimato lacgi ken gi?”<verse eid="2KI 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 18:28" />Ci Rabcake ocung ocako dange ki dwon malongo i leb Juda ni, “Wuwiny lok pa rwot madit, rwot me Aciria! <verse eid="2KI 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 18:29" />Rwot me Aciria owaco kuman ni, ‘Pe wuwek Kejekia obed kabwolowu, pien en pe bitwero larowu ki i cinga. <verse eid="2KI 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 18:30" />Pe wuwek Kejekia omii wujenge ikom Rwot Lubanga kun wuwaco ni, Rwot Lubanga aye bilarowu dok taun madit man pe kibimiyo i cing rwot me Aciria.’ <verse eid="2KI 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 18:31" />Pe wubed kawinyo lok pa Kejekia; pien man aye lok ma rwot me Aciria owaco ni, ‘Wuyub lok me kuc kweda, ci wukat woko bota; kitmeno ngat acel acel bicamo nyig olok ma i potone, dok ngat acel acel bicamo nyig odurune, ki ngat acel acel bene bimato pii ma i kulune kikome; <verse eid="2KI 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 18:32" />nio ka abiterowu wa i lobo marom ki mewuni, lobo ma ceko ngano ki kongo bwino, lobo ma miyowu mugati ki poto olokgu, lobo ma moo jeituni ki moo kic dwong iye, wek wubed ma komwu yot, wek pe wubed ka to atoya. Pe wubed kawinyo lok pa Kejekia matye ka bwolowu kwedeni kun waco ni, Rwot Lubanga bilarowu. <verse eid="2KI 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 18:33" />Tye lubanga pa lurok mo mayam olaro lobone ki i cing rwot me Aciria? <verse eid="2KI 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 18:34" />Lubanga pa jo Kamat ki Arpad gitye kwene ka? Lubanga pa jo Ceparvaim, nyo Kena ki Iva gitye kwene? Gin gularo Camaria ki i cinga bo? <verse eid="2KI 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 18:35" />Lubanga me lobo mene ki ikin lubanga ducu ma gitye ki lobogi, mayam kong olaro lobone ki i cinga mono, ma omiyo wutamo ni Rwot Lubanga bilaro Jerucalem ki i cingani?’”<verse eid="2KI 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 18:36" />Ento lwak ducu guling alinga, pe gudoke iye lok mo kadi ki acel, pien onongo rwot ociko ni, “Pe wubigamo doge.” <verse eid="2KI 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 18:37" />Ci Eliakim wod pa Kilkia ma en aye ladit maloyo jami ma i ot pa rwot, kacel ki Cebna ma karan, ki Joa wod pa Acap ma lacoo lok matime guyeco bongigi, gucito kwede wa bot Kejekia ci gutite lok ducu ma Rabcake owaco.<verse eid="2KI 18:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2KI 19" />
  <para style="s1">Kejekia openyo tam ki bot lanebi Icaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ISA 37:1-7">Ica 37:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 19:1" />Ka Kejekia owinyo, ci oyeco bongine woko, ci oume ki bongo cola, ocito kwede wa i Ot pa Lubanga. <verse eid="2KI 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 19:2" />Ci ooro Eliakim ma lalo jami ma i ode, kacel ki Cebna ma karan, ki ajwaki pa Lubanga ma gutegi ma guumu komgi woko ki bongo cola, ci ocwalogi bot Icaya wod pa Amoj, ma lanebi. <verse eid="2KI 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 19:3" />Ci guwaco bote ni, “Kejekia owaco kuman ni, tin nino me can atika, kitye kapwodowa, dok lewic omakowa mada. Wan kombedi watye calo dako ma cawa me nyodone dong oromo, ento peke ki teko me colo latin. <verse eid="2KI 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 19:4" />Rwot me Aciria ocwalo Rabcake ma ladit wi monye ducu ka nywaro Lubanga makwo. Gwok nyo Rwot Lubangani dong otyeko winyo lok me ayet magi ducu ci bipwodo jo ducu ma guloko lok magi. Pimeno dong ileg Lubanga pi jo ma gubwot.” <verse eid="2KI 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 19:5" />Ka lutic pa rwot Kejekia guo bot Icaya, <verse eid="2KI 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 19:6" />ci Icaya owaco botgi ni, “Wuwac bot laditwu ni, ‘Rwot owaco kuman ni, pe ibed ki lworo mo pi lok ma iwinyoni, ma lutic pa rwot me Aciria gubedo kayeta kwede. <verse eid="2KI 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 19:7" />Nen, abikete cwiny mo i iye, ci biwinyo lok ngurunguru mo ma biweko en dok woko wa i lobo tugi; ci abimiyo kineko en woko ki pala lucwan ki i lobo tugi kunu.’”<verse eid="2KI 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo Aciria dok gucwalo lok me bura mukene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ISA 37:8-20">Ica 37:8-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 19:8" />Ka Rabcake odok, ci onongo rwot me Aciria tye kalweny ikom Libna; pien onongo owinyo ni rwot otyeko a woko ki i Lakic. <verse eid="2KI 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 19:9" />Kace rwot owinyo lok ikom Tiraka rwot me Etiopia, nen en otingo yoo me bino kalweny ikome, en dok ocwalo lukwena bot Kejekia kun waco ni, <verse eid="2KI 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 19:10" />“Wubiwaco bot Kejekia rwot me Juda kit man ni, ‘Pe iwek Lubangani ma ijenge ikomeni obed kabwoli, kun ciko ni Jerucalem pe bipoto i cing rwot me Aciria. <verse eid="2KI 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 19:11" />Nen, in dong ityeko winyo gin mayam luker me Aciria gutiyo ikom lobo ducu, ma gutyekogi woko ducu liweng, ci i tamoni in aye ki bilari? <verse eid="2KI 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 19:12" />Lubanga pa lurok yam pe olarogi, lurok mayam kwarina gutyekogi woko ducu, ma gin aye jo Gojan, jo Karan, jo Recep ki jo Eden mayam gitye i Telacar. <verse eid="2KI 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 19:13" />Rwot me Kamat, nyo me Arpad, rwot me taun madito me Ceparvaim, me Kena, nyo me Iva gitye kwene?’”<verse eid="2KI 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 19:14" />Ka Rwot Kejekia ogamo waraga ki i cing lukwenanu, ci okwano. Ka oa ocito i Ot pa Lubanga, ci oyaro waraga woko piny inyim Rwot. <verse eid="2KI 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 19:15" />Ci olego inyim Rwot kun waco ni, “Ai Rwot, Lubanga pa Icrael, ma ibedo iwi komkeri ka wi lukerubi, in aye Lubanga, in keni ma i loyo lwak ker ducu ma i lobo; in aye i cweyo polo ki lobo. <verse eid="2KI 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 19:16" />Cik iti ai Rwot, i winywa; yab wangi, ai Rwot, i nenwa; kong iwiny lok pa Cenakerib ma ocwalo me cayo Lubanga makwoni. <verse eid="2KI 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 19:17" />Adada, ai Rwot, luker me Aciria gujwero rok ducu wa ki lobogi ducu, <verse eid="2KI 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 19:18" />dok gutyeko bolo lubangagi woko i mac; pien onongo gin pe Lubanga kikome, gin tic me cing dano, yen ki gotgu, ma omiyo kityekogi woko. <verse eid="2KI 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 19:19" />Kitmeno, ai Rwot, abako doga boti, i larwa ki i cinge, wek ker ma iwi lobo ducu onge ni in, ai Rwot, in Lubanga in keni.”<verse eid="2KI 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok ma Icaya ocwalo bot rwot</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ISA 37:21-38">Ica 37:21-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 19:20" />Ci Icaya wod pa Amoj odwoko lok bot Kejekia kun waco ni, “Rwot, Lubanga pa Icrael, owaco ni etyeko winyo legani ma ilego ikom Cenakerib rwot me Aciria. <verse eid="2KI 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 19:21" />Man aye lok ma Rwot owaco ikome ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:21">‘Jo Cion gicayi in Cenakerib</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:21">gicayi kun gijeri;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:21">jo Jerucalem bene gicayi, kun giyengo wigi ki i ngeyi.<verse eid="2KI 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 19:22" />In itye kacayo anga dok anga mono ma i yetoni?’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:22">In imoro dwoni ikoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:22">ikom an ngat Maleng me Icrael kulu kun inena ki wang me awaka!<verse eid="2KI 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 19:23" />In aye ma imiyo lutici gubino kanyate bota, kun iwaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">in ki lwak gadigadi lwenyi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">ityeko mayo godi ducu me Lebanon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">Dok iwake bene ni dong ityeko tongo yadi cedar maboco ki kunu woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">ki yadi ciprec ma becone madani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">dok iwaco beneni, dong idonyo wa i bungane kamabor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">kama yadi ocule iye liking.<verse eid="2KI 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 19:24" />Iwake bene ni ikwinyo wang pii ci imato pii i lobo pa lurok;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:24">dok ni lwak buca mony ma meri gunyono jang kulu Nail ma i lobo Ejipt ci gutwoyo woko.<verse eid="2KI 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 19:25" />In peya iwinyo bo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:25">ni an aye ma atyeko yubu yub magi wa yam con?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:25">Dok dong atyeko timogi woko kombedi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:25">Yam ayubu wa ikare macon ca,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:25">ni in myero i tur taun magi ducu ma ki celogi ki cel gogo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:25">wek i lokgi odok obur ma odure lipim.<verse eid="2KI 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 19:26" />Jo ma gibedo iye gudoko goro;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:26">cwinygi obale, lewic omakogi, gudoko macalo ginapita ma i poto, gicalo lum alita</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:26">macalo lum ma otwi iwi ot, ma bware woko ma pud otwi atwiya.<verse eid="2KI 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 19:27" />Ento angeyo lok komi weng, kama i cito iye ki gin ducu ma itiyo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:27">An bene angeyo jenyeni ikoma.<verse eid="2KI 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 19:28" />Pien ibedo ka jenye ikoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:28">dok lok anywari otyeko donyo i ita,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:28">omiyo abirwako golina i umi, abiketo tola i dogi ci abidwoki cen i yoo kama yam i wok ki iye.”<verse eid="2KI 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 19:29" />Lacen Icaya owaco bot rwot Kejekia ni, “Man aye bibedo lanyut boti me poyo wi: i mwaka man wubicamo cam ma otwi kene, i mwaka me aryone wubicamo cam ma dok otwi i okang, ento i mwaka me adeke wubicoyo kodi ci wubikayo, dok wubipito olok ci wubicamo nyige. <verse eid="2KI 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 19:30" />Ki jo ma gubwot ma gudong ki i ot pa Juda gibibedo calo yat ma rwako lwite piny, dok ma nyako nyige. <verse eid="2KI 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 19:31" />Pien jo ma gudong bibedo tye i Jerucalem, ki lwak jo mubwot ki iwi got Cion bene bibedo tye. Man bitime pi mar ma pe loke ma Rwot me mony tye kwede pirwu.<verse eid="2KI 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 19:32" />Pieno Rwot owaco kuman ikom rwot me Aciria ni, ‘En pe bidonyo i taun man, dok pe bibayo nyig atero mo kadi ki acel iye. Pe tye mony mo ma binyiko cok kwede ki kwot, dok bene en pe bitoro cel lobo mo me rumune. <verse eid="2KI 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 19:33" />Yoo mayam en obino kwedeni, aye bibedo yoo acelu ma en bidok kwede bene; en pe bidonyo i taun madit man. Man lok pa Rwot Lubanga kikome. <verse eid="2KI 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 19:34" />An abilwenyo pi taun madit man me larone pira kena, ki pi latica Daudi.’”<verse eid="2KI 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 19:35" />I dyewor meno lamalaika pa Rwot ocito, oneko jo Aciria alip miya acel ki pyere aboro wiye abic ki i gonygi. Ka dano gua malo odiko con, ci nen, gunongo kom jo Aciria ma oto orade lirat. <verse eid="2KI 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 19:36" />Cenakerib rwot me Aciria ogware odok cen i taun madit me Nineve, ci obedo kunu. <verse eid="2KI 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 19:37" />Ka yam en tye ka woro i ot pa lubangane Nicirok, ci awobene Adramelek ki Carejer, guneke woko ki pala lucwan, ci guringo gularo komgi wa i Ararat. Wode Ecar-kadon aye odoko rwot oleyo katyene.<verse eid="2KI 19:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2KI 20" />
  <para style="s1">Two pa Kejekia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 32:24-26">2 Tek 32:24-26</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 38:1-8">Ica 38:1-8</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 38:21-22">21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 20:1" />Ikare meno two omako Kejekia ma onongo cok to woko. Ci Icaya wod pa Amoj ocito bote, ci owaco bote ni, “Rwot waco kuman ni, ‘Yub odi obed maber, pien i bito woko, twoni pe bicang.’” <verse eid="2KI 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 20:2" />Ka Kejekia owinyo lok man, ci oloko wange ikom kicika ot kun lego ni, <verse eid="2KI 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 20:3" />“Ai Rwot abako doga boti, kong ipo, dok inen kit kwo ma abedo kwede inyimi, kun abedo ngat ma geni, dok alubu in ki cwinya ducu, kun abedo katiyo gin manen maber i wangi.” Ci Kejekia ocako koko matek tutwal ki toncwiny. <verse eid="2KI 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 20:4" />Ikare ma Icaya oa ki inyim rwot, ento ma peya okato woko ki idyekal ma idyere, ci Rwot owaco bote ni, <verse eid="2KI 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 20:5" />“Dok cen, icit iwac bot Kejekia rwot maloyo lwaka ni, ‘Rwot, ma Lubanga pa woru Daudi owaco kuman ni: atyeko winyo kokoni, dok aneno pig wangi bene. Nen, abicango twoni woko; ikom nino me adeke en aye i bicito kwede wa i Ot pa Lubanga. <verse eid="2KI 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 20:6" />Dok abimedo mwaka apar wiye abic ikom wel mwaka me kwoni. Abilaro in ki taun madit man ki i cing rwot me Aciria; abilweny pi taun madit man pira kena ki pi cikena bot latica Daudi.’” <verse eid="2KI 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 20:7" />Ci Icaya odok cen i ot pa rwot ci owaco ki lutic pa rwot ni, “Wureg pok oduru, wek wuket iwang odekene, wek ocang woko.”<verse eid="2KI 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 20:8" />Ci rwot Kejekia openyo Icaya ni, “Gin ango ma binyutu ni Rwot Lubanga bicango twona, ci abicito wa i Ot pa Lubanga inino me adeke?”<verse eid="2KI 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 20:9" />Ci Icaya ogamo ni, “Rwot bimiyi lanyut ma oa ki bote ma nyutu ni en bitiyo gin ma otyeko ciko pireni. Gin ango ma dong iyero; imitoni tipu ocit anyim marom ki rwom apar, kece nyo odok ki ngeye rwom apar?” <verse eid="2KI 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 20:10" />Kejekia odok iye ni, “Tipu nino jwi gire woto mede anyim. Ma ka mede anyim rwom apar; ber iwek odok ki ngeye rwom apar.” <verse eid="2KI 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 20:11" />Ci lanebi Icaya okok bot Rwot, ci Rwot odwoko tipu cen rwom apar kama nene oryene omede ikom gin me poro ceng ma rwot Akaj yam oketo.<verse eid="2KI 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kejekia ojolo lukwena ma gua ki i Babilon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ISA 39:1-8">Ica 39:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 20:12" />Ikare meno Merodak-baladan wod pa Baladan rwot me Babilon, ocwalo lukwena ma gukelo waraga kacel ki mot bot Kejekia; pien onongo owinyo ni Kejekia kome lit. <verse eid="2KI 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 20:13" />Kejekia ojologi maber, ci onyutu botgi ot lime ducu, ki ryal, jabu, angwece, moo me wel, ki jami lwenye. Kejekia onyutu gin ducu ma onongo tye i ot kano jamine; gin mo pe odong ma pe onyutugi, ma i ode nyo ma ite kere ducu. <verse eid="2KI 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 20:14" />Lacen lanebi Icaya obino bot rwot Kejekia, ci openye ni, “Jo meno guwaci lok ango? Dok gua ki kwene?” Ci Kejekia ogamo ni, “Jo meno gua ki i lobo mabor, gua wa i Babilon.” <verse eid="2KI 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 20:15" />Ci Icaya dok openyo en ni, “Guneno gin ango ki i odi?” Ci Kejekia ogamo ni, “Jonu guneno jami ducu matye i oda; gin mo pe odong ki i ot kano jamina ma pe anyutu botgi.”<verse eid="2KI 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 20:16" />Ci Icaya owaco bot Kejekia ni, “Dong iwiny lok pa Rwot. <verse eid="2KI 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 20:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:13">2 Luk 24:13</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:10">2 Tek 36:10</ref></char></note> Kare dong biromo ma kibitero jami ducu ma i odi, wa ki mayam kwarini gukano nio wa onyo woko wa i Babilon; gin mo pe bidong. <verse eid="2KI 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 20:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:14-15">2 Luk 24:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 1:1-7">Dan 1:1-7</ref></char></note>Ki awobeni mogo ma in inywalo bene ki biterogi woko; dok kibikolo mangi woko, ci gibidoko lutic i gangkal pa rwot me Babilon.” <verse eid="2KI 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 20:19" />Ci Kejekia owaco bot Icaya ni, “Lok pa Rwot ma iwaconi ber mere.” Pien en onongo otamo ni, “Race tye kwene, teke ka wabedo ki kuc ma lobo okwe mot ikare ma pud akwo?”<verse eid="2KI 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">To pa Kejekia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 32:32-33">2 Tek 32:32-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 20:20" />Lok kom Kejekia mudonge ducu, ki teke ducu, ki kit mayam okwinyo kwede joro ki yoo pii makelo pii wa i dye Jerucalem kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro pa Luker me Juda.</char> <verse eid="2KI 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 20:21" />Kejekia oto, ci kiyike kacel ki kwarine, ci wode Manace aye oleyo katyene.<verse eid="2KI 20:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2KI 21" />
  <para style="s1">Loc pa Manace rwot me Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 33:1-20">2 Tek 33:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 21:1" />Manace ocamo ker ma mwaka me dite romo apar wiye aryo, ci obedo kaloc ki i Jerucalem pi mwaka pyere abic wiye abic. Nying mine Kepjiba. <verse eid="2KI 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 21:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:4">Jer 15:4</ref></char></note>Manace obedo katiyo gin manen marac iwang Rwot, kun lubu kwede tim me kwer pa rok ducu ma Rwot yam oryemogi woko ki inyim jo Icrael. <verse eid="2KI 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 21:3" />En dok oroco wang jogi pa lurok ma iwi godi mayam wone Kejekia ojwerogi wokoni. En ogero keno tyer pa Baal, ka dok ocomo wir cal jogi pi woro jok ma dako ma kilwongo Acera, kit mayam Akab rwot me Icrael otiyoni, ci bene obedo ka woro ceng ki dwe wa ki lakalatwer ducu, kun tiyo botgi. <verse eid="2KI 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 21:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:13">2 Cam 7:13</ref></char></note>Dok ocano lwak keno tyer pi woro jogi wa i Ot pa Lubanga, kama yam Rwot owaco ni kibiworo en iye i Jerucalem. <verse eid="2KI 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 21:5" />Ka dok ocano lwak keno tyer pi woro ceng ki dwe wa ki lakalatwer ducu idyekal aryo me Ot pa Lubanga. <verse eid="2KI 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 21:6" />Manace bene owango wode ki mac me gityer, dok bene obedo katyet, ki ngiyo i dyelgu, kun tiyo ki lukor tipugu ki megi jogi. En obedo katiyo kit tim mapol manen marac iwang Rwot, kun miyo kiniga mako Rwot. <verse eid="2KI 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 21:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:3-5">1 Luk 9:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 7:12-18">2 Tek 7:12-18</ref></char></note>Ka dok omiyo ki payo cal Acera ma jok ma dakoni, ci ocibo i ot mayam Rwot owaco ikome bot Daudi ki wode Solomon ni, “I ot man, ki i Jerucalem, en aye kabedo mayam ayero ki ikin kaka pa jo Icrael ducu, abiketo nyinga bedo iye matwal. <verse eid="2KI 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 21:8" />Teke jo Icrael gibigwoke kalubu cika ducu, mayam latica Moses ocikogi kwede kun gilubu kit lok ducu ma atyeko cikogi kwede, ci pe dok abimiyo ki ryemogi woko ki i lobo mayam amiyo bot kwarigini.” <verse eid="2KI 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 21:9" />Ento jo Juda pe yam guwinyo, dok Manace obitogi omiyo gubedo katimo gin marac, makato lurok ma Rwot yam ojwerogi woko ki inyim jo Icrael.<verse eid="2KI 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 21:10" />Rwot oloko ki i dog lunebi ma lutice kun waco ni, <verse eid="2KI 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 21:11" />“Manace rwot me Juda obedo katimo tim me kwer, maracu makato mayam jo Amor ma gukwongo nyime gubedo katiyone, dok omiyo jo Juda bene gubalo pi woro lwak cal lubangane. <verse eid="2KI 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 21:12" />Piman, an Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael awaco ni, abikelo gin marac ikom Jerucalem ki ikom lobo Juda ma jo ducu ma biwinyone bibedo ki ngeng wa ki lworo madit mada. <verse eid="2KI 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 21:13" />Dok abipwodo Jerucalem ki kit pwod acel mayam apwodo kwede ki Camaria, abingolo lakit pwod acel mayam apwodo kwede ki ot pa Akab. Dok abijwayo Jerucalem kit ma dano jwayo ki caanini, kun jwayo kome ka dok ryebo iye umu woko piny. <verse eid="2KI 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 21:14" />Abikwero jona mudongi woko ma gin aye lwaka, ci amiyogi woko i cing lumerokgi. Gibidoko ginayaka ma lumerokgi giyako, <verse eid="2KI 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 21:15" />pien gubedo katiyo gin manen marac i wanga, kun gumiyo kiniga obedo ka maka nia wa ikare ma kwarigi oa kwede i Ejipt nio kwede wa onyo.”<verse eid="2KI 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 21:16" />Dok bene Manace obedo kaneko jo mapol ma pe gitye ki bal mo, nio ka remogi oromo i Jerucalem woko ducu. Medo ikom meno, en bene omiyo jo Juda gubalo kun gitiyo gin manen marac iwang Rwot.<verse eid="2KI 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 21:17" />Lok kom Manace mudonge ducu, ki gin ducu mayam otiyo, ki bal ma otiyo, kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro pa Luker me Juda.</char> <verse eid="2KI 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 21:18" />Manace oto, ci kiyike kacel ki kwarine i poto ma inget ode, ma poto pa Uja; ci wode Amon aye oleyo katyene.<verse eid="2KI 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Loc pa Amon rwot me Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 33:21-25">2 Tek 33:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 21:19" />Amon ocamo ker ma mwaka me dite onongo tye pyere aryo wiye aryo, ci obedo kaloc ki i Jerucalem pi mwaka aryo. Nying mine Meculemet ma nya pa Karuj, dano me Jotba. <verse eid="2KI 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 21:20" />Amon obedo katiyo gin manen marac iwang Rwot, kit macalo wone Manace obedo katiyo. <verse eid="2KI 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 21:21" />En obedo kalubu kit pa wone ducu, kun tiyo bot cal lubangagu mayam wone otiyo botgi, kun worogi bene. <verse eid="2KI 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 21:22" />En obwoto Rwot, Lubanga pa kwarine woko, pe obedo kalubu kit pa Rwot. <verse eid="2KI 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 21:23" />Lutic pa Amon gupiro lok ikome, ci guneko en woko i ode. <verse eid="2KI 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 21:24" />Ento lwak ma i lobo Juda guneko jo ducu ma gupiro lok ikom rwot Amon ci guketo wode Yocia me bedo rwot ma kakare.<verse eid="2KI 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 21:25" />Lok kom Amon mudonge ducu ki gin mayam otiyo ducu kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro pa Luker me Juda.</char> <verse eid="2KI 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 21:26" />Kiyike i lyel ma i poto pa Uja; wode Yocia oleyo katyene.<verse eid="2KI 21:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2KI 22" />
  <para style="s1">Loc pa Yocia rwot me Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 34:1-2">2 Tek 34:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 22:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 3:6">Jer 3:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yocia ocamo ker ma mwaka me dite onongo tye aboro, ci obedo kaloc ki i Jerucalem pi mwaka pyere adek wiye acel. Nying mine Yedida, ma nya pa Adaya me Bojkat. <verse eid="2KI 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 22:2" />Yocia obedo katiyo gin manen atir iwang Rwot; kun lubu kit pa kwarone Daudi ducu labongo cabe atata, kun lubu cik pa Lubanga ducu.<verse eid="2KI 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kinongo buk me Cik i Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 34:8-28">2 Tek 34:8-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 22:3" />I mwaka me apar wiye aboro me loc pa rwot Yocia, en ocwalo Capan wod pa Ajalia, wod pa Meculam ma karan, wa i Ot pa Lubanga kun waco ni, <verse eid="2KI 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 22:4" />“Cit wa bot Kilkia ma ajwaka madit, wek en okwan wel lim ma kikelo i Ot pa Lubanga, ma lukur dogola gugamo ki bot lwak. <verse eid="2KI 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 22:5" />Wac bote ni omii lim meno i cing lutic ma giloyo dog tic me Ot pa Lubanga. Wek gucul lutic magi ma gitye kunu ka roco kama obale ikom Ot pa Lubanga: <verse eid="2KI 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 22:6" />gin aye lupac ki lugedo, lugedo ki godi wek guti kwede me wilo bao bene, ki godi ma kimuku pi yubu kama obale. <verse eid="2KI 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 22:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 12:15">2 Luk 12:15</ref></char></note>Ento pe gupeny lok kom lim mo ma kimiyo i cinggi, pien gin gitiyo kwede ki gen.”<verse eid="2KI 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 22:8" />Kilkia ma ajwaka madit, owaco bot Capan ma karan ni, “Atyeko nongo buk me Cik i Ot pa Lubanga.” Ci Kilkia omiyo buk bot Capan, ci okwano. <verse eid="2KI 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 22:9" />Ci Capan ma karan ocito kwede bot rwot, ci odwoko lok bot rwot ni, “Ladit, watyeko kwanyo lim ma kinongo i Ot pa Lubanga, ci wamiyo i cing lutic ma giloyo dog tic me Ot pa Lubanga.” <verse eid="2KI 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 22:10" />Ci Capan ma karan dok otito ki rwot ni, “Kilkia ajwaka madit otyeko miya buk mo.” Ka Capan ocako kwanone inyim rwot.<verse eid="2KI 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 22:11" />Ka rwot Yocia owinyo lok ma i buk me Cik, ci oyeco bongine woko. <verse eid="2KI 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 22:12" />Ci ocako ciko Kilkia ma ajwaka madit, ki Akikam wod pa Capan, ki Akbor wod pa Mikaya, ki Capan ma karan, ki Acaya ma latic pa rwot kun waco ni, <verse eid="2KI 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 22:13" />“Wucit ka penyo dog Rwot Lubanga pira, pi lwak, ki pi ker me Juda ducu, pi lok ma i buk man ma kityeko nongoneni. Akemo pa Rwot kara dong olyeti ikomwa matek, pien kwariwa pe gubedo ka woro lok ducu ma i buk man, pi tic kwede ikit ducu mayam kicoyo kwede ma mako komwa.”<verse eid="2KI 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 22:14" />Ci Kilkia, ajwaka madit, Akikam, Akbor, Capan ki Acaya gucito bot Kulda ma lanebi ma dako, ma cware Calum wod pa Tikva, ma wod pa Karkac ma lagwok bongi pa rwot, ci guloko kwede. Dakonu onongo bedo i dul gang me aryone ma pud onongo nyen i Jerucalem. <verse eid="2KI 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 22:15" />Ci en owaco botgi ni, “Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael dong otyeko lok! Wutit bot dano ma ocwalowu bota ni, <verse eid="2KI 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 22:16" />‘Rwot Lubanga owaco kuman ni: abikelo gin marac poto ikom kabedo man, ki ikom jo ma gibedo iye, pi cobo lok ducu ma kicoyo i buk ma rwot me Juda okwanoni. <verse eid="2KI 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 22:17" />Pien jona gutyeko bwota woko kun giwango odok eceta bot lwak lubanga mukenegu, wek kimii kiniga obed ka maka pi jogi ducu ma gitiyo ki cingini. Piman akemona bilyeti matek ikom kabedo man, ma pe dong bikwe. <verse eid="2KI 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 22:18" />Ento lok ma dok ikom rwot me Juda ma ocwalowu kapenyo dog Rwot, wun wubiwaco bote kit man ni: ikom lok ma iwinyoni, <verse eid="2KI 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 22:19" />dong ityeko ngut ki i cwinyi, ci imwole keni inyim Rwot ikare ma iwinyo kit lok mayam aloko ikom kabedo man, ki ikom jo ma gibedo iye, ni bidoko obur, miyo kibitic ki nyinge macalo lok lacen dano, ci icako yeco bongini woko kun i kok kwede inyima; pimeno an bene atyeko winyo kokoni, man lok pa Rwot kikome. <verse eid="2KI 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 22:20" />Pe dong abicwalo can man ikare me kwoni, ento abikuru ka dong in ito, ma kiyiki i lyeli ki kuc, dok wangi pe bineno gin marac ducu ma abikelo ikom kabedo man.’” Ci gin gudwoko lok bot rwot.<verse eid="2KI 22:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2KI 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yocia ojwero ka woro jokgu woko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 34:3-7">2 Tek 34:3-7</ref>,<ref loc="2CH 34:29-33">29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 23:1" />Rwot Yocia ocwalo kwena, ci ludongo me Juda ducu ki me Jerucalem gucoke bote. <verse eid="2KI 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 23:2" />Ci ocito kacel ki jo Juda ducu, jo ducu ma gibedo i Jerucalem, ajwaki, lunebi, ki lwak ducu, jo matino ki jo madito wa i Ot pa Lubanga. Ci ocako kwano lok ducu ma i buk me gicike ma kinongo i Ot pa Lubanga, kun gin ducu giwinyo. <verse eid="2KI 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 23:3" />Lacen rwot Yocia ocung ka nget wir ci oketo gicike ki Rwot, kun moko inyim Rwot, me lubu lok pa Rwot, kun mako lok ma Rwot ociko ducu, ki lok me caden, ki cikgu ducu, me mako ki cwinye ducu ki tipune ducu, kun cobo kwede lok me gicike meno, mayam kicoyo i buk meno. Ci lwak ducu guribe kamoko gicike.<verse eid="2KI 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 23:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 21:3">2 Luk 21:3</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 33:3">2 Tek 33:3</ref></char>
    </note>Rwot Yocia ociko Kilkia, ajwaka madit, ki ajwaki ma i dul me aryo, ki lukur dogola ni gukel jami ducu matye i Ot pa Lubanga mayam kitiyogi pi Baal, ki pi jok ma dako ma kilwongo Acera, ki pi lakalatwer ma i polo ducu. Ci guwangogi woko inge Jerucalem, i poti ma i ora kulu Kidron, ci gutero burugi wa i Betel. <verse eid="2KI 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 23:5" />Ci okwanyo ajwaki me wang jogi mayam luker me Juda guketogi me wango odok eceta iwang jogi ma iwi godi ma inget taun madito ma i Juda, ki ma gurumu Jerucalem, kacel ki jo ma giwango odok eceta bot jok Baal, ki bot ceng ki dwe, ki lakalatwe ducu ma i polo. <verse eid="2KI 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 23:6" />Ka dok okwanyo cal Acera ma jok ma dakoni woko ki i Ot pa Lubanga, ci otero woko wa inge Jerucalem, i kulu Kidron, ci owango woko i ora me Kidron, oluru matinotino tutwal, ci oonyo kama kiyiko iye dano ata. <verse eid="2KI 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 23:7" />En bene omuku odi pa lutim kwele ma luwor jogi, ma onongo gukube ikom Ot pa Lubanga, kama yam mon gicweyo iye bongo pi Acera. <verse eid="2KI 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 23:8" />Ka dok ocoko lwak ajwaki pa jogi woko ki i taun madito ma i Juda ci oterogi i Jerucalem, ka omuku lwak wang jogi ma iwi godi kama kiwango iye odok eceta; cake ki i Geba nio kwede wa i Beer-ceba. En omuku bene wang jogi pa nyogi oyima, mayam gitye i dog gang ma kidonyo kwede i gang pa Yocwa ma laloc me Jerucalem, tung kumalo ka i donyo i dogcel. <verse eid="2KI 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 23:9" />Ajwakinu ducu ma iwang jogi ma iwi godi yam pe kiyegi katic inyim keno tyer pa Rwot Lubanga i Jerucalem, ento gubedo kacamo Mugati ma Tobi Pe iye ki ikin utmegigi. <verse eid="2KI 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 23:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:21">Lev 18:21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:31">Jer 7:31</ref>; <ref loc="JER 19:1-6">19:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:35">32:35</ref></char></note>Rwot Yocia dok obalo Topet, ma onongo tye i nota pa wod pa Kinom, wek dano mo pe dok owang iye wode nyo nyare ki mac me gityer bot jok Molek. <verse eid="2KI 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 23:11" />Ka dok omuku lwak cal aguragura mayam luker me Juda gudyero bot ceng, kama kidonyo kwede i Ot pa Lubanga, inget kicika pa Natan-melek, dano ma kikolo ma tiyo i ot pa rwot, ma idyekal me Ot pa Lubanga; ka owango gadigadi pa ceng ki mac. <verse eid="2KI 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 23:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 21:5">2 Luk 21:5</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 33:5">2 Tek 33:5</ref></char></note>Lwak keno tyer mayam obedo iwi kicika mamalo me ot pa Akaj, mayam luker me Juda gutiyo, kacel ki keno tyer mayam Manace ocano idyekal aryo ducu me Ot pa Lubanga, magi ducu en omuku oreto woko piny, ongidogi woko matinotino, ci oonyogi i nota me kulu Kidron. <verse eid="2KI 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 23:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:7">1 Luk 11:7</ref></char></note>Rwot Yocia dok obalo wang jogi ma iwi godi mayam gitye inget Jerucalem tung kunyango, kupiny me got me bal, ma en aye got Jeituni, mayam Solomon rwot me Icrael ogero pi Acitoret ma jok ma dako pa jo Cidon, pi Kemoc ma jok pa jo Moab, ki pi Milkom ma jok pa jo Ammon. <verse eid="2KI 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 23:14" />Ka dok oturu wir jogi ducu ongido woko, ka otongo cal ma kicomo pi woro Acera ma jok ma dakoni, ka opongo kabedogi ki cogo kom dano wek pe dok obed mupore me woro lubanga mo keken i ye.<verse eid="2KI 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 23:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 12:33">1 Luk 12:33</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Keno tyer ma i Betel bene, ki wang jok mayam Jeroboam wod pa Nebat ocano, mayam omiyo jo Icrael gupoto i bal, keno tyer meno bene en Yocia omukugi woko kacel ki godi ma kicano ka ongidogi woko matino, ci orego odoko luru; ka dok owango cal jok Acera bene. <verse eid="2KI 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 23:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:2">1 Luk 13:2</ref></char></note>Ka Yocia dok oloke, ci oneno lwak lyel iwi got; ci ocwalo dano okwanyo lwak cogo ma i lyel ducu, ci owangogi iwi keno tyer. Kitmeno en obalo kenone woko, ocobo ki lok pa Rwot mayam dano pa Lubanga otito kun nyutu kwede gin ma bitime anyim, ikare me karama ma Jeroboam onongo ocung inyim keno tyer. Ci rwot Yocia oloke oneno lyel pa dano pa Lubanga ma otito lok magi. <verse eid="2KI 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 23:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:30-32">1 Luk 13:30-32</ref></char></note>Ci openyo ni, “Got ma ocung ca kicano me po ikom anga?” Ci jo me taun meno gutite ni, “Meno lyel pa dano pa Lubanga mayam oa ki i Juda, ma okwongo tito lok magi ducu madong ityeko cobogi ikom keno tyer man ma i Betel.” <verse eid="2KI 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 23:18" />Ci Yocia ogamo ni, “Wek obedi; pe dano mo okwany cogone.” Ci guweko cogone, pe gugudu kacel ki cogo pa lanebi mayam oa ki i Camaria. <verse eid="2KI 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 23:19" />Wa i taun ducu ma i Camaria, mayam luker me Icrael gugero, rwot Yocia omuku odi jogi ducu ma iwang jogi ma iwi godi ma onongo miyo kiniga mako Rwot. Yocia omukugi woko, ci otiyo ikomgi kit mayam otimo i Betel ducu. <verse eid="2KI 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 23:20" />Dok oneko ajwaki ducu ma iwang jogi ma iwi godi, en onekogi iwi keno tyergi, ka owango cogo komgi iwi keno tyer meno ducu. Ci odok woko i Jerucalem.<verse eid="2KI 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yocia okwero Karama madit me Kato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 35:1-19">2 Tek 35:1-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 23:21" />Rwot Yocia dok ociko lwak ducu ni, “Wukwer Karama madit me Kato pa Rwot Lubangawu, kit mayam kicoyo i buk man me gicike.” <verse eid="2KI 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 23:22" />Pe tye Karama me Kato mo ma kikwero madit kit man i Icrael, cake ki ikare pa lungolkop mayam giloyo Icrael, kadi wa ikare pa luker me Icrael nyo me Juda. <verse eid="2KI 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 23:23" />Ento i mwaka me apar wiye aboro me loc pa Yocia en aye kikwero iye Karama me Kato pa Rwot madit i Jerucalem.<verse eid="2KI 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Alokaloka mukene ma Yocia okelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 23:24" />Kitmeno, Yocia ojwero lukor tipu woko, ki lujogigu, kacel ki cal jogi matinone ma dano gubedo kwede i pacogi, cal jogi mukenegu, ki gin me ki pyeda ducu ma gunen i lobo Juda ki i Jerucalem, wek emok lok me cik ducu mayam kicoyo i buk ma ajwaka Kilkia onongo i Ot pa Lubanga. <verse eid="2KI 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 23:25" />Onongo yam pe tye rwot mo marom kwede ki ikin luker ducu ma gutelo nyime, ma kong oloke bot Rwot ki cwinye ducu ki tipu kome ducu, ki teke ducu kun lubu Cik pa Moses ducu; dok pe tye dano mo ma olubu ngeye ma obedo marom kwede.<verse eid="2KI 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 23:26" />Kadi bed kumeno, cwiny Rwot ma opong ki akemo mager ikom Juda pi tim maracu pa rwot Manace onongo peya oware dok bene onongo en peya oloko tame. <verse eid="2KI 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 23:27" />Rwot onongo owaco ni, “Abiryemo Juda bene woko ki inyima, kit macalo atyeko ryemo Icrael woko ki i nyimani, dok abikwero Jerucalem ma en aye taun madit ma ayeroni woko, kacel ki Ot pa Lubanga mayam aloko ikome ni nyinga bibedo kunu.”<verse eid="2KI 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">To pa Yocia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 35:20-36:1">2 Tek 35:20—36:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 23:28" />Lok kom Yocia mudonge ducu, ki gin mayam otiyo ducu, kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro pa Luker me Juda.</char><verse eid="2KI 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 23:29" />I karene en aye Parao Neko rwot me Ejipt ocito ki buca monye kakonyo rwot me Aciria i dog kulu Euprate. Ci rwot Yocia ocito kajuku mony pa jo Ejipt; ci Parao Neko ka onene, oneke woko cut i Megiddo. <verse eid="2KI 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 23:30" />Ci lutice gutingo kome ki gadigadi nia ki i Megiddo, gutero i Jerucalem, ci guyike i lyele kikome.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 23:30">Ludito me lobo Juda gukwanyo Yekoakaj wod pa Yocia guwiro ki moo, ci guketo en me bedo rwot, oleyo katyen wone.<verse eid="2KI 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Loc pa Yekoakaj rwot me Juda ki tone</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 36:2-4">2 Tek 36:2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 23:31" />Yekoakaj ocamo ker ma mwaka me dite pyere aryo wiye adek, ci obedo kaloc i Jerucalem pi dwe adek. Nying mine Kamutal, nya pa Jeremia me Libna. <verse eid="2KI 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 23:32" />En obedo katiyo gin manen marac iwang Rwot, kun lubu kit ducu mayam kwarine gutiyo. <verse eid="2KI 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 23:33" />Parao Neko otweyo en woko i buc i Ribla i lobo Kamat, wek pe obed kaloc i Jerucalem, ci ongolo wel ajog ikom lobo Juda maromo talanta me ryal miya acel ki talanta me jabu acel. <verse eid="2KI 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 23:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:11-12">Jer 22:11-12</ref></char></note>Parao Neko oketo Eliakim wod pa Yocia obedo rwot me leyo katyen wone Yocia ci oloko nyinge odoko Yekoyakim. Otero Yekoakaj wa i Ejipt, ci oto woko ki kunu. <verse eid="2KI 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 23:35" />Yekoyakim yam omiyo ryal ki jabu meno bot Parao, ento kong ojogo ajog i lobone pi nongo wel lim ma Parao ociko. En ojogo ryal ki jabu ki bot wegi lobo, kun gamo ki bot dano acel acel muporo wel ma kingolo ikome me amiya bot Parao Neko.<verse eid="2KI 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Loc pa Yekoyakim rwot me Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 36:5-8">2 Tek 36:5-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 23:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:36: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 22:18-19">Jer 22:18-19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 26:1-6">26:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 35:1-19">35:1-19</ref></char>
    </note>Yekoyakim ocamo ker ma mwaka me dite pyere aryo wiye abic, ci obedo kaloc ki i Jerucalem pi mwaka apar wiye acel. Nying mine Jebida, nya pa Pedaya me Ruma. <verse eid="2KI 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 23:37" />En obedo katiyo gin manen marac iwang Rwot kun lubu gin ducu mayam kwarine gutiyo.<verse eid="2KI 23:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2KI 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 24:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 25:1-38">Jer 25:1-38</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 1:1-2">Dan 1:1-2</ref></char>
    </note>Ikare pa Yekoyakim en aye Nebukadnejar, rwot me Babilon, obino omonyo lobo Juda, ci Yekoyakim odoko latice pi mwaka adek; lacen en oloke ojemo woko ikome. <verse eid="2KI 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 24:2" />Ci Rwot Lubanga ocwalo buca mony pa jo Kaldaya, pa jo Ciria, pa jo Moab, ki buca mony pa jo Ammon; kalweny ikom jo Juda pi jwerogi woko ducu, kit mayam Rwot oloko ki i dog lutice ma lunebi. <verse eid="2KI 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 24:3" />Meno ducu opoto ikom jo Juda pi cik pa Rwot, wek okwanygi woko ki inyime, pi bal ducu ma Manace yam otiyo, <verse eid="2KI 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 24:4" />ki pi remo pa jo ma pe ki bal ma en ooyo i Jerucalem. Rwot pe otimo kica pi bal meno.<verse eid="2KI 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 24:5" />Lok kom Yekoyakim mudonge ducu, ki gin mayam otiyo, kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro pa Luker me Juda.</char> <verse eid="2KI 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 24:6" />Yekoyakim oto, ci kiyike kacel ki kwarine ci wode Yekoyakin aye oleyo katyene. <verse eid="2KI 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 24:7" />Rwot me Ejipt pe dok onwoyo a ki i lobone, pien onongo rwot me Babilon otyeko mayo lobo woko ki i cinge, cake ki i nota ora me Ejipt o kwede wa i kulu Euprate ducu.<verse eid="2KI 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yekoyakin rwot me Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 36:9-10">2 Tek 36:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 24:8" />Yekoyakin ocamo ker ma mwaka me dite apar wiye aboro, ci obedo kaloc ki i Jerucalem pi dwe adek. Nying mine Nekocita, nya pa Elnatan me Jerucalem. <verse eid="2KI 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 24:9" />En obedo katiyo gin manen marac iwang Rwot, kun lubu gin ducu mayam wone otiyo.<verse eid="2KI 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 24:10" />Ikare meno aye lutic pa Nebukadnejar, rwot me Babilon, obino ki monye i Jerucalem, ci orumu woko. <verse eid="2KI 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 24:11" />Rwot Nebukadnejar ocito i Jerucalem Ikare ma lutice gurumu wokoni. <verse eid="2KI 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 24:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:24-30">Jer 22:24-30</ref>; <ref loc="JER 24:1-10">24:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 29:1-2">29:1-2</ref></char></note>Ci Yekoyakin rwot me Juda oye miine kekene i cing rwot me Babilon, en kikome, ki mine ki lutice, ki rwodine, ki ludito ma i kale. Rwot me Babilon otweyo en i buc i mwaka me aborone me loce. <verse eid="2KI 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 24:13" />Nebukadnejar otero jami ducu ma kikano i ot lim ma i Ot pa Lubanga i Jerucalem, ki lim ducu ma kikano i ot ker, ka otongo jami me jabu ma i Ot pa Lubanga ongidogi woko ducu, gin jami mayam Solomon rwot me Icrael otiyo, kit mayam Rwot Lubanga oloko. <verse eid="2KI 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 24:14" />En bene otero jo me Jerucalem ducu, rwodi ducu, twoni oteka lweny ducu ma guromo alip apar, kacel ki ludiro tic mapatpat ducu ki lutet nyonyo i opii. Dano acel mo pe odong, kono jo ma lucan atika aye gudong i lobo pa Juda. <verse eid="2KI 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 24:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 17:12">Eje 17:12</ref></char></note>Nebukadnejar otero Yekoyakin woko i opii wa i Babilon, kacel ki min rwot, mon pa rwot, luditone ki rwodi ma giloyo lwak ma i lobonu. <verse eid="2KI 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 24:16" />Rwot me Babilon otero lwak opii ma gin ducu oteka lweny ma giromo alip abiro, ludiro tic mapatpat ki lutet ma giromo alip acel, gin ducu jo matego ma giromo mony. <verse eid="2KI 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 24:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 37:1">Jer 37:1</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 17:13">Eje 17:13</ref></char></note>Rwot me Babilon dok oketo Matania ma omin won Yekoyakin obedo rwot ma oleyo katyene, ci oloko nyinge odoko Jedekia.<verse eid="2KI 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Loc pa Jedekia rwot me Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 36:11-16">2 Tek 36:11-16</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:1-3a">Jer 52:1-3a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 24:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 27:1-22">Jer 27:1-22</ref>; <ref loc="JER 28:1-17">28:1-17</ref></char>
    </note>Jedekia ocamo ker ma mwaka me dite pyere aryo wiye acel, ci obedo kaloc ki i Jerucalem pi mwaka apar wiye acel. Nying mine Kamutal, nya pa Jeremia me Libna. <verse eid="2KI 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 24:19" />En obedo katiyo gin manen marac iwang Rwot, kun lubu gin ducu mayam Yekoyakin otiyo. <verse eid="2KI 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 24:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 17:15">Eje 17:15</ref></char></note>Pi kiniga ma omako Rwot Lubanga matek ikom jo Jerucalem ki jo Juda, omiyo en oryemogi woko ki inyime.<verse eid="2KI 24:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="2KI 25" />
  <para style="s1">Jerucalem opoto i cing jo Babilon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 36:13-21">2 Tek 36:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:3b-11">Jer 52:3b-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 25:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 21:1-10">Jer 21:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 34:1-5">34:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 24:2">Eje 24:2</ref></char>
    </note>Lacen Jedekia ojemo woko ikom rwot me Babilon. Ci i mwaka me abongwen me loce, i dwe me apar, inino dwe apar, en aye Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon obino kwede ki monye ducu ikom Jerucalem, ci orumu gang woko, ka dok gutoro cel lobo orumu woko dyere. <verse eid="2KI 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 25:2" />Kirumu Jerucalem kitmeno nio wa i mwaka me apar wiye acel me loc pa rwot Jedekia. <verse eid="2KI 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 25:3" />Ikom nino dwe abongwen me dwe me angwen onongo kec odoko marac i Jerucalem, ma omiyo cam pe dok onen pi lwak. <verse eid="2KI 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 25:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 33:21">Eje 33:21</ref></char></note>Ka gumuku but cel me taun woko, ci rwot ki lwak lulweny ducu gumol gulwi woko ki i dyewor, kun giwok ki i dog gang ma ikin cel aryo me Jerucalem, ma inget poto pa rwot. Ento pien jo Babilon onongo gurumu taun woko dyere, omiyo gucito gulubu yoo ma dok tung Araba. <verse eid="2KI 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 25:5" />Ento mony pa jo Babilon guryemo kor rwot Jedekia, ci gumake wa i bar me Jeriko; ci monye guket woko ducu ki ikome. <verse eid="2KI 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 25:6" />Ka gumako rwot Jedekia, ci gukelo en bot rwot me Babilon i Ribla, kama ongole iye kop. <verse eid="2KI 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 25:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 12:13">Eje 12:13</ref></char></note>Ka gucako neko awobe pa Jedekia woko ki inyime ma wange neno, ka kikolo wange woko, ka kitweye ki nyor, kitere kwede wa i Babilon.<verse eid="2KI 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muku Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JER 52:12-30">Jer 52:12-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 25:8" />I dwe me abic, ikom nino dwe me abirone, i mwaka me abongwen me loc pa rwot Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon, en aye Nebujaradan ma ladit pa lugwok rwot, ma latic pa rwot me Babilon, odonyo kwede i Jerucalem. <verse eid="2KI 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 25:9" />En owango Ot pa Lubanga woko, ki ot pa rwot, ki odi ducu matye i Jerucalem; dok bene owango odi ma pirgi tego woko ducu ki mac. <verse eid="2KI 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 25:10" />Ki mony pa jo Babilon ducu, mayam gitye kacel ki ladit pa lugwok rwot, gumuku kicika cel murumu Jerucalem woko. <verse eid="2KI 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 25:11" />Ci Nebujaradan otero lwak mayam gudong i taun madit, ki jo mayam gumine gigi ken gi bot rwot me Babilon, kacel ki lwak ma gudonge ducu i opii. <verse eid="2KI 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 25:12" />Ento oweko lucan mogo gudong i lobo Juda wek gubed lugwok poto olok ki lupur ki kweri dyang.<verse eid="2KI 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 25:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 7:15-26">1 Luk 7:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 3:15-17">2 Tek 3:15-17</ref></char>
    </note> Ci jo Babilon guturu wir mola aryo mayam gitye i Ot pa Lubanga, ki lutino gadigadi ki twon pipa me mola mayam gitye i Ot pa Lubanga, gungido woko ka gutero woko i Babilon. <verse eid="2KI 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 25:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:45">1 Luk 7:45</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 4:16">2 Tek 4:16</ref></char></note>Gin bene gutero lwak agulu ducu, akwaya latokegu, magacgu ki atabo me odok eceta, jami mola ducu mayam kitiyo kwedgi i Ot pa Lubanga. <verse eid="2KI 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 25:15" />Nebujaradan bene otero wee me wango mac, ki becengu mayam kitiyo ki jabu, ki ryal. <verse eid="2KI 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 25:16" />Wir aryoni, ki twon pipa pii me mola acel, ki lutino gadigadi ducu, mayam Solomon otiyo pi Ot pa Lubanga, pek me mola ma oa ki ikom jami magi ducu dwong ma pe pime. <verse eid="2KI 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 25:17" />Bor pa wir acel acel romo puti pyere aryo wiye abiro. I wigi yam kiketo iye lalukana me mola, kun borgi romo puti angwenangwen ki nucu. Ikom lalukana onongo kiketo iye obwo ki cal nyig okwer pomegranat, ma gin ducu kitiyogi ki mola, ma kirumu lalukana dyere.<verse eid="2KI 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kitero jo me Juda i opii i Babilon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JER 52:24-27">Jer 52:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 25:18" />Ladit pa lugwok rwot otero Ceraya bene ma ajwaka madit, ki Jepania, ajwaka me aryone, ki lukur dogola me Ot pa Lubanga gin adek. <verse eid="2KI 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 25:19" />Ka dok okwanyo ladit maloyo lumony ki i dye gang, ki lumemba abic ma gin lumiitam bot rwot ma onongogi i dye taun; ki karan pa ladit me mony mayam coko jo me lobo pi lweny, ki jo pyere abic ikin wegi lobo ma ki nongogi i dye taun. <verse eid="2KI 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 25:20" />Nebujaradan ladit pa lugwok rwot omakogi, oterogi wa i Ribla bot rwot me Babilon. <verse eid="2KI 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 25:21" />Rwot me Babilon onekogi woko ducu; en onekogi i Ribla ma i lobo Kamat. Jo Juda yam ki kwanyogi woko ki i lobogi ci ki terogi i opii kitmeno.<verse eid="2KI 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiketo Gedilia obedo ladit me Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JER 40:7-9">Jer 40:7-9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 41:1-3">41:1-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 25:22" />Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon oketo Gedalia wod pa Akikam ma wod pa Capan me loyo jo mudong i lobo Juda, mayam owekogi gubwot. <verse eid="2KI 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 25:23" />Ka ludito me mony ducu ma ikin gangi guwinyo ni rwot me Babilon otyeko keto Gedalia me bedo laloyo, ci gubino ki lwakgi bot Gedalia wa i Mijpa. Nyingi ene: Icmael wod pa Netania, Yokanan wod pa Karea, Ceraya wod pa Tankumet ma jo Netopa, ki Jajania wod pa jo Maaka. <verse eid="2KI 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 25:24" />Gedalia ocako kwongo kwong botgi ki bot lwakgi ducu kun waco ni, “Pe wulwor ludito tic pa jo Babilon. Wubed i lobo, wutii bot rwot me Babilon, ci wubibedo maber labongo ayela mo.” <verse eid="2KI 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 25:25" />Ento i dwe me abiro, Icmael wod pa Netania, wod pa Elicama, matye i kaka pa luker, obino kacel ki jo apar, ci gulwenyo ki Gedalia, guneko woko, kacel ki Lujudaya ki jo Babilon ma gitye kwede i Mijpa. <verse eid="2KI 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 25:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 43:5-7">Jer 43:5-7</ref></char></note>Lacen lwak ducu, jo matino ki madito, ki ludito me mony gua gucito wa i Ejipt, pien gulworo jo Babilon.<verse eid="2KI 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kigonyo Yekoyakin ki i buc</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JER 52:31-34">Jer 52:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 25:27" />Ikare me mwaka pyere adek wiye abirone nia ma ki tero kwede Yekoyakin rwot me Juda i opii, i dwe me apar wiye aryo, ikom nino dwe pyere aryo wiye abiro, en aye Evil-merodak, rwot me Babilon, otimo kica ki Yekoyakin rwot me Juda, ogonye woko ki i buc, i mwaka ma en ocamo iye ker. <verse eid="2KI 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 25:28" />Ci obedo kalok kwede mot maber, oketo en obedo ikom madit makato ducu ma ikin kom pa luker ma onongo gibedo kwede i Babilon. <verse eid="2KI 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 25:29" />Kitmeno omiyo Yekoyakin olunyu bongo buc mere woko, ci obedo kacam iwi meja pa rwot jwijwi, pi kare me kwone ducu. <verse eid="2KI 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 25:30" />Pi miye gin me konye kwede, rwot me Babilon dok obedo kamiye lim me tic kwede jwijwi, pi kare ducu me kwo mere.<verse eid="2KI 25:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 25" />
</usx>